"Skin-tight nylon leggings, sometimes used when exercising, that keep your "
"legs nice and warm."
msgstr ""
"Leotardos de nailon ajustados, que mantienen tus piernas abrigadas. Se "
"utilizan a veces para hacer ejercicio."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of hard leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of hard leg guards"
msgstr[0] "par de perneras duras"
msgstr[1] "pares de perneras duras"

#. ~ Description for pair of hard leg guards
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A pair of polyurethane leg guards with neoprene backing."
msgstr "Un par de mangas de poliuretano para piernas, reforzado con neopreno."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of steel leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of steel leg guards"
msgstr[0] "par de perneras de acero"
msgstr[1] "pares de perneras de acero"

#. ~ Description for pair of steel leg guards
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full assembly of medieval leg protection.  Cuisses, poleyns, and greaves, "
"with leather straps to secure each piece and connect it as part of a set."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of iron greaves"
msgid_plural "pairs of iron greaves"
msgstr[0] "par de grebas de hierro"
msgstr[1] "pares de grebas de hierro"

#. ~ Description for pair of iron greaves
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A pair of iron leg guards with a simple leather lining."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de protectores para las piernas con un revestimiento simple de "
"cuero."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of paper leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of paper leg guards"
msgstr[0] "par de mangas de papel para piernas"
msgstr[1] "pares de mangas de papel para piernas"

#. ~ Description for pair of paper leg guards
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Leg guards made of stacked paper sheets held together with duct tape."
msgstr ""
"Son unas mangas para piernas hechas de montones de papel, sujetas entre sí "
"con cinta adhesiva."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of drop leg pouches"
msgid_plural "pairs of drop leg pouches"
msgstr[0] "par de pierneras"
msgstr[1] "pares de pierneras"

#. ~ Description for pair of drop leg pouches
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of pouches that can be worn on the thighs using buckled straps.  This "
"variety is favored by the military."
msgstr ""
"Son unas pierneras que se sujetan a los muslos con correas con hebillas, y "
"sirven para llevar cosas. Son las que utilizan los soldados."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Linux t-shirt"
msgid_plural "Linux t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "camiseta de Linux"
msgstr[1] "camisetas de Linux"

#. ~ Description for Linux t-shirt
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with a picture of the Tux mascot on it.  Underneath it says \"You "
"wouldn't buy a car with the hood welded shut.\""
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta con el dibujo de la mascota Tux. Abajo dice \"Nunca comprarías "
"un coche con el capó soldado.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with a picture of Tux, the Linux mascot!  It says \"You wouldn't "
"buy a car with the hood welded shut.\""
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta con el dibujo de Tux, la mascota de Linux. Dice \"No deberías "
"comprar un coche con el capó soldado.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Ubuntu logo on it, underneath it says \"Ubuntu is a South"
" African word for 'I can't configure Debian'\""
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta con el logo de Ubuntu, y abajo dice \"Ubuntu es una palabra "
"sudafricana que significa 'No puedo configurar Debian'.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Arch Linux logo on it, underneath it says \"Keep it "
"Simple Stupid\""
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta con el logo de Arch Linux, y abajo dice \"Mentenelo simple "
"estúpido.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Ubuntu logo on it, underneath it says \"Linux for human "
"beings\""
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta con el logo de Ubuntu, y abajo dice \"Linux para seres "
"humanos.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Linux Mint logo on it, underneath it says \"From freedom "
"came elegance\""
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta con el logo de Linux Mint, y abajo dice \"De la libertad vino "
"la elegancia.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Fedora logo on it, underneath it says \"Freedom. Friends."
" Features. First.\""
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta con el logo de Fedora, y abajo dice \"Libertad. Amigos. "
"Funciones. Primero.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with Red Hat's logo on it, underneath it says \"The World's Open "
"Source Leader\""
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta con el logo de Red Hat, y abajo dice \"El líder mundial en "
"código abierto.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Debian logo on it, underneath it says \"The Universal "
"Operating System\""
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta con el logo de Debian, y abajo dice \"El sistema operativo "
"universal.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "locket"
msgid_plural "lockets"
msgstr[0] "relicario"
msgstr[1] "relicarios"

#. ~ Description for locket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small locket with a frame inside to store photographs or small objects."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño relicario en el cual se pueden guardar fotografías u objetos "
"pequeños."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "loincloth"
msgid_plural "loincloths"
msgstr[0] "taparrabos"
msgstr[1] "taparrabos"

#. ~ Description for loincloth
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Rags stitched together and tied into a makeshift loincloth.  Covers your "
"modesty, but not much else."
msgstr ""
"Es un taparrabos hecho con trapos cosidos y atados. Mantiene cubierta tu "
"decencia, pero no mucho más."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "fur loincloth"
msgid_plural "fur loincloths"
msgstr[0] "taparrabos de piel"
msgstr[1] "taparrabos de piel"

#. ~ Description for fur loincloth
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fur pelt tied into a loincloth.  Covers your modesty, but not much else.  "
"Now you are a true barbarian warrior."
msgstr ""
"Es un taparrabos hecho con una piel atada. Mantiene cubierta tu decencia, "
"pero no mucho más. Ahora eres un verdadero guerrero bárbaro."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "leather loincloth"
msgid_plural "leather loincloths"
msgstr[0] "taparrabos de cuero"
msgstr[1] "taparrabos de cuero"

#. ~ Description for leather loincloth
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Leather patches stitched together and tied into a makeshift loincloth.  "
"Covers your modesty, but not much else."
msgstr ""
"Es un taparrabos hecho con pedazos de piel cosidos y atados. Mantiene "
"cubierta tu decencia, pero no mucho más."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "wool loincloth"
msgid_plural "wool loincloths"
msgstr[0] "taparrabo de lana"
msgstr[1] "taparrabos de lana"

#. ~ Description for wool loincloth
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bits of wool stitched together and tied into a makeshift loincloth.  Covers "
"your modesty, but not much else."
msgstr ""
"Es un taparrabos hecho con pedazos de lana cosidos y atados. Mantiene "
"cubierta tu decencia, pero no mucho más."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of extra long white gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of extra long white gloves"
