"Some peanut butter smothered between two pieces of bread.  Not very filling "
"and will stick to the roof of your mouth like glue."
msgstr ""
"Es un poco de mantequilla de cacahuetes entre dos pedazos de pan. No te "
"llena mucho y se te pega al paladar como pegamento."

