"A broken grenade hack.  Much less threatening now that it lies quiet on "
"solid ground.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Un grana-hack roto. Ahora que está tirado quieto en el suelo no es tan "
"amenazante. Puede ser destripado para recuperar las partes."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken mininuke hack"
msgid_plural "broken mininuke hacks"
msgstr[0] "minibom-hack roto"
msgstr[1] "minibom-hacks rotos"

#. ~ Description for broken mininuke hack
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A broken magenta hack.  Just looking at the wreck makes you shiver.  Could "
"be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Un minibomba-hack magenta roto. Solamente al mirar los pedazos ya te hace "
"temblar. Puede ser destripado para recuperar las partes."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
