msgstr ""
"Puedes moverte más rápido que la mayoría. Tienes un 15% de bonus sobre la "
"velocidad normal a pie."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Good Hearing"
msgstr "Buen Oído"

#. ~ Description for Good Hearing
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your hearing is better than average, and you can hear distant sounds more "
"easily."
msgstr ""
"Tienes mejor oído que lo normal, y puedes oir sonidos distantes con mayor "
"facilidad."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Outdoorsman"
msgstr "Amante de la Naturaleza"

#. ~ Description for Outdoorsman
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are accustomed to being exposed to the elements.  This decreases morale "
"penalties for being wet."
msgstr ""
"Estás acostumbrado a estar al aire libre. Esto hace que sea menor la "
"penalización a la moral por estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Parkour Expert"
msgstr "Experto/a en Parkour"

#. ~ Description for Parkour Expert
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're skilled at clearing obstacles; terrain like railings or counters are "
"as easy for you to move on as solid ground."
msgstr ""
"Tienes habilidad para franquear obstáculos. Cosas como pasamanos o mesadas "
"son tan fáciles de transitar para ti como el suelo mismo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Indefatigable"
msgstr "Incansable"

#. ~ Description for Indefatigable
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Whether due to exercise and good diet, or due to a natural propensity to "
"physical endurance, you tire due to physical exertion much less readily than"
" others.  Your maximum stamina is 25% higher than usual."
msgstr ""
"Ya sea debido al ejercicio y la buena dieta, o debido a ser naturalmente "
"propenso a la resistencia física, el esfuerzo físico te cansa mucho menos "
"que a los demás. Tu máxima resistencia es un 25% mayor que lo normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hyperactive"
msgstr "Hiperactivo"

#. ~ Description for Hyperactive
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your body's efficiency is like that of a tiny furnace, increasing your "
"maximum stamina by 40%."
msgstr ""
"La eficacia de tu cuerpo es como la de un pequeño horno, incrementando tu "
"resistencia máxima en un 40%."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Quick"
msgstr "Rápido/a"

#. ~ Description for Quick
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You're just generally quick!  You get a 10% bonus to action points."
msgstr ""
"¡Eres más rápido para todo! Tienes un bonus del 10% a tus puntos de acción."

#. ~ Description for Optimist
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Nothing gets you down!  You savor the joys of life, ignore its hardships, "
"and are generally happier than most people."
msgstr ""
"¡Nada te deprime! Saboreás los placeres de la vida, ignorás las "
"dificultades, y en general eres más feliz que la mayoría de la gente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fast Healer"
msgstr "Sanador/a Veloz"

#. ~ Description for Fast Healer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You heal faster when sleeping and will even recover a small amount of HP "
"when not sleeping."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Light Eater"
msgstr "Apetito ligero"

#. ~ Description for Light Eater
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your metabolism is a little slower, and you require less food than most."
msgstr ""
"Tu metabolismo es un poco más lento, y necesitas menos comida que la mayoría"
" de la gente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Accomplished Sleeper"
msgstr "Dormilón/a Consumado/a"

#. ~ Description for Accomplished Sleeper
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have always been able to fall asleep easily, even when sleeping in less "
"than ideal circumstances."
msgstr ""
"Siempre tuviste la capacidad de dormirte fácilmente, incluso cuando tienes "
"que dormir en circunstancias poco ideales."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Practiced Sleeper"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Practiced Sleeper
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body's demanding energy needs mean you can fall asleep just about "
"anywhere."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pain Resistant"
msgstr "Resistente al Dolor"

#. ~ Description for Pain Resistant
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You have a high tolerance for pain."
msgstr "Tienes una gran tolerancia al dolor."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Night Vision"
msgstr "Visión Nocturna"

#. ~ Description for Night Vision
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You possess natural night vision, and can see further in the dark than most."
"  Activate to toggle NV-visible areas on or off."
msgstr ""
"Tienes visión nocturna natural y puedes ver un poco más de lo normal en la "
"oscuridad. Hay que activarlo para encender y apagar las áreas visibles por "
"Visión Nocturna."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Poison Resistant"
msgstr "Resistente al Veneno"

#. ~ Description for Poison Resistant
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your system is rather tolerant of poisons and toxins, and most will affect "
"you less."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema es bastante tolerante a los venenos y toxinas, y la mayoría te "
"afectará menos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fast Reader"
msgstr "Lector/a Veloz"

#. ~ Description for Fast Reader
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're a quick reader, and can get through books a lot faster than most."
msgstr ""
"Eres rápido para leer, puedes terminar libros mucho más rápido que los "
"demás."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tough Feet"
msgstr "Pies Fuertes"

#. ~ Description for Tough Feet
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The bottoms of your feet are tough and you are accustomed to going barefoot."
"  You receive no movement penalty for not wearing shoes."
msgstr ""
"Las plantas de tus pies son resistentes y estás acostumbrado a andar en "
"patas. Si no usas nada en los pies, no se te aplica ninguna penalización."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tough"
msgstr "Duro"

#. ~ Description for Tough
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"It takes a lot to bring you down!  You get a 20% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr ""
"¡Derrotarte cuesta mucho! Tienes un 20% de bonus a tus puntos de vida."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Durable"
msgstr "Durable"

#. ~ Description for Durable
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You can shrug off almost anything!  You get a 30% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr ""
"¡Casi nada te hace mella! Tienes un 30% de bonus a tus puntos de vida."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Unbreakable"
msgstr "Irrompible"

#. ~ Description for Unbreakable
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "Nothing can break you!  You get a 40% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr "¡Nada te puede romper! Tienes un 40% de bonus a tus puntos de vida."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Thick-Skinned"
msgstr "Piel Gruesa"

#. ~ Description for Thick-Skinned
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skin is tough.  Cutting damage is slightly reduced for you.  Slightly "
"decreases wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel es resistente. El daño cortante es reducido levemente. También "
"reduce las penalidades por estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Packmule"
msgstr "Mula de Carga"

#. ~ Description for Packmule
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You can manage to find space for anything!  You can carry 40% more volume."
msgstr ""
"¡Siempre encuentras un lugarcito para tus cosas! Puedes cargar un 40% más de"
" volumen."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Strong Back"
msgstr "Espalda Fuerte"

#. ~ Description for Strong Back
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are capable of carrying far more than someone with similar strength "
"could.  Your maximum weight carried is increased by 35%."
msgstr ""
"Eres capaz de cargar mucho más que una persona con fuerza similar. Tu máxima"
" carga posible está incrementada en un 35%."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fast Learner"
msgstr "Aprendiz Veloz"

#. ~ Description for Fast Learner
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a flexible mind, allowing you to learn skills much faster than "
"others.  Note that this only applies to real-world experience, not to skill "
"gain from other sources like books."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una mente flexible que te permite aprender habilidades mucho más "
"rápido que los demás. Esto solo se aplica para la experiencia práctica, no "
"para las habilidades aprendidas de libros y similares."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Strong Stomach"
msgstr "Estómago Fuerte"

#. ~ Description for Strong Stomach
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are less likely to throw up from food poisoning, alcohol, etc.  If you "
"throw up nevertheless, you won't suffer a residual nausea."
msgstr ""
"Eres menos propenso a vomitar por intoxicación con la comida, el alcohol, "
"etc. Si de todas maneras igual vomitas, no vas a sufrir de náuseas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Good Memory"
msgstr "Buena Memoria"

#. ~ Description for Good Memory
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have an exceptional memory, and find it easy to remember things.  Your "
"skills will erode slightly slower than usual, and you can remember more "
"terrain."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Deft"
msgstr "Hábil"

#. ~ Description for Deft
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While you're not any better at melee combat, you are better at recovering "
"from a miss, and will be able to attempt another strike faster."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no eres mejor en el combate cuerpo a cuerpo, eres mejor para "
"recuperarte de un golpe errado, y podrás intentar otro golpe más rápido."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Drunken Master"
msgstr "Borracho/a Maestro/a"

#. ~ Description for Drunken Master
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The ancient arts of drunken brawling come naturally to you!  While under the"
" influence of alcohol, your melee skill will rise considerably, especially "
"unarmed combat."
msgstr ""
"¡El antiguo arte de las peleas de borrachos es natural para ti! Mientras "
"estás bajo la influencia del alcohol, tu habilidad de cuerpo a cuerpo se "
"incrementa considerablemente, especialmente en el combate desarmado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Spiritual"
msgstr "Espiritual"

#. ~ Description for Spiritual
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've always felt that there is more to the world than we can see.  Whether"
" driven by religious beliefs or philosophical interest, you find great "
"inspiration in studying holy texts and experiencing mystical things."
msgstr ""
"Siempre sentiste que hay algo más en el mundo que lo que podemos ver. Ya sea"
" por creencias religiosas o intereses filosóficos, encuentras gran "
"inspiración en estudiar los textos sagrados y experimentar cosas místicas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Substance Tolerance"
msgstr "Tolerante a Sustancias"

#. ~ Description for Substance Tolerance
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can handle intoxicants well.  Their effects clear up more quickly for "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Puedes manejar bien las intoxicaciones. Sus efectos se van a ir más rápido."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Gourmand"
msgstr "Gourmet"

#. ~ Description for Gourmand
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You eat faster, and can eat and drink more, than anyone else!  You also "
"enjoy food more; delicious food is better for your morale, and you don't "
"mind unsavory meals as much.  Activate to skip prompt for overeating."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bookworm"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Bookworm
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There's nothing quite like the smell of a good book!  Books are more fun (or"
" less boring) for you!"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Addiction Resistant"
msgstr "Resistir Adicciones"

#. ~ Description for Addiction Resistant
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Whether due to a lifetime of exposure or through simple willpower, it's "
"harder for you to become addicted to substances, and easier to rid yourself "
"of these addictions."
msgstr ""
"Ya sea por una vida de revelación o por simple fuerza de voluntad, es más "
"difícil hacerte adicto a una sustancia, y te resulta más fácil salir de las "
"adicciones."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Animal Empathy"
msgstr "Empatía Animal"

#. ~ Description for Animal Empathy
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Peaceful animals will not run away from you, and even aggressive animals are"
" less likely to attack.  This only applies to natural animals such as "
"woodland creatures."
msgstr ""
"Los animales pacíficos no se escaparán cuando te vean, e incluso los "
"animales agresivos te atacarán menos. Esto solo se aplica a los animales "
"naturales como las criaturas del bosque."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Terrifying"
msgstr "Aterrador/a"

#. ~ Description for Terrifying
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There's something about you that creatures find frightening, and they are "
"more likely to try to flee."
msgstr ""
"Hay algo en ti que causa terror. Las criaturas tienden a escaparse cuando te"
" ven."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Disease Resistant"
msgstr "Resistir Enfermedades"

#. ~ Description for Disease Resistant
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's very unlikely that you will catch ambient diseases like a cold or the "
"flu."
msgstr ""
"Es muy raro que te cojas una enfermedad ambiental como un resfriado o gripe."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "High Adrenaline"
msgstr "Alta Adrenalina"

#. ~ Description for High Adrenaline
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you are in a very dangerous situation, you may experience a temporary "
"rush which increases your speed and strength significantly."
msgstr ""
"Si te encuentras en una situación muy peligrosa, puedes experimentar un "
"empujón temporal que incrementa significativamente tu velocidad y tu fuerza."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Less Sleep"
msgstr "Menos Sueño"

#. ~ Description for Less Sleep
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You need less sleep than the average person."
msgstr "Necesitas dormir menos que una persona normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Self-Aware"
msgstr "Consciente de Sí Mismo/a"

#. ~ Description for Self-Aware
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You get to see your exact amount of HP remaining and health, instead of only"
" having a vague idea of whether you're in good condition or not."
msgstr ""
"Puedes ver la cantidad exacta de PV que tienes y tu salud, en lugar de tener"
" una vaga idea de si estás en buena condición o no."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Inconspicuous"
msgstr "Discreto/a"

#. ~ Description for Inconspicuous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While sleeping or staying still, it is less likely that monsters will wander"
" close to you."
msgstr ""
"Mientras estás durmiendo o cuando te quedás quieto, es muy poco probable que"
" los monstruos se te acerquen."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Masochist"
msgstr "Masoquista"

#. ~ Description for Masochist
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Although you still suffer the negative effects of pain, it also brings a "
"unique pleasure to you."
msgstr ""
"Aunque igual vas a sufrir las penalidades por el dolor, a la vez vas a "
"sentir placer."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Stimulant Psychosis"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Stimulant Psychosis
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a unique history with stimulants (like coffee or amphetamines). You"
" can tolerate a lot more of them without overdosing, but if you indulge too "
"much, you start seeing things..."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Stylish
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Practicality is far less important than style.  Your morale is improved by "
"wearing fashionable and attractive clothing."
msgstr ""
"La funcionalidad es mucho menos importante que el estilo. Tu moral mejora "
"cuando vistes ropas fascinantes y de moda."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Light Step"
msgstr "Paso ligero"

#. ~ Description for Light Step
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You make less noise while walking.  You're also less likely to set off "
"traps."
msgstr ""
"Haces menos ruido cuando caminas. También eres menos propenso a caer en "
"trampas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Robust Genetics"
msgstr "Genética Robusta"

#. ~ Description for Robust Genetics
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a very strong genetic base.  If you mutate, the odds that the "
"mutation will be beneficial are greatly increased."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una base genética muy fuerte. Si sufres una mutación, son mucho "
"mayores las posibilidades de que sea una beneficiosa."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Scout"
msgstr "Explorador/a"

#. ~ Description for Scout
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're an excellent navigator and your ability to spot distant landmarks is "
"unmatched.  Your sight radius on the overmap extends beyond the normal "
"range."
msgstr ""
"Eres un excelente explorador y tu habilidad para distinguir puntos de "
"referencia distantes no tiene comparación. Tu radio de visión en el mapa "
"general se extiende más allá del rango normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Topographagnosia"
msgstr "Topografagnosia"

#. ~ Description for Topographagnosia
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Focal brain damage has rendered you incapable of recognizing landmarks and "
"orienting yourself in your surroundings, severely crippling your sight "
"radius on the overmap."
msgstr ""
"Una lesión cerebral focal te ha dejado incapaz de reconocer puntos de "
"referencia en el terreno y de orientarte, lo que incapacita severamente tu "
"radio de visión en el mapa."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Cannibal"
msgstr "Caníbal"

#. ~ Description for Cannibal
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"For your whole life you've been forbidden from indulging in your peculiar "
"tastes.  Now the world's ended, and you'll be damned if anyone is going to "
"tell you that you can't eat people."
msgstr ""
"Toda tu vida te han prohibido satisfacer tus particulares gustos. Ahora que "
"el mundo se terminó, ya nadie podrá venir a decirte que no te puedes comer "
"una persona."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Psychopath"
msgstr "Psicópata"

#. ~ Description for Psychopath
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You don't experience guilt like others do.  Even when you know your actions "
"are wrong, you just don't care."
msgstr ""
"No experimentas la culpa de la misma manera que lo hacen los demás. Incluso "
"cuando sabes que tus acciones están mal, simplemente no te importa."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Martial Arts Training"
msgstr "Artes Marciales"

#. ~ Description for Martial Arts Training
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have received some martial arts training at a local dojo.  You start "
"with your choice of Karate, Judo, Aikido, Tai Chi, or Taekwondo."
msgstr ""
"Recibiste entrenamiento en algún arte marcial en tu dojo local. Empiezas con"
" uno de estos estilos a elección: Karate, Judo, Aijido, Tai Chi o Taekwondo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Self-Defense Classes"
msgstr "Defensa Personal"

#. ~ Description for Self-Defense Classes
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have taken some self-defense classes at a nearby gym.  You start with "
"your choice of Capoeira, Krav Maga, Muay Thai, Ninjutsu, or Zui Quan."
msgstr ""
"Has recibido clases de defensa personal en un gimnasio de tu barrio. "
"Empiezas con uno de estos estilos a elección: Capoeira, Krav Maga, Muay "
"Thai, Ninjutsu o Zui Quan."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Shaolin Adept"
msgstr "Experto/a Shaolin"

#. ~ Description for Shaolin Adept
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have studied the arts of the Shaolin monks.  You start with one of the "
"five animal fighting styles: Tiger, Crane, Leopard, Snake, or Dragon."
msgstr ""
"Has estudiado las artes de los monjes Shaolin. Empiezas con uno de estos "
"estilos de lucha a elección: Tigre, Grulla, Leopardo, Serpiente o Dragón."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Venom Mob Protege"
msgstr "Pupilo/a Mafia del Veneno"

#. ~ Description for Venom Mob Protege
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are a pupil of the Venom Clan.  You start with one of the five deadly "
"venoms: Centipede, Viper, Scorpion, Lizard, or Toad."
msgstr ""
"Eres un pupilo del Clan del Veneno. Empiezas con uno de estos cinco venenos "
"mortales: Ciempiés, Víbora, Escorpión, Lagarto o Sapo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Melee Weapon Training"
msgstr "Armas Cuerpo a cuerpo"

#. ~ Description for Melee Weapon Training
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have practiced fighting with weapons.  You start with your choice of "
"Eskrima, Fencing, Pentjak Silat, Niten Ichi-Ryu, or Sōjutsu."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Weak Scent"
msgstr "Poco Olor"

#. ~ Description for Weak Scent
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your scent is quite weak.  Animals that track your scent will do so with "
"more difficulty."
msgstr ""
"Tu olor es bastante débil. A los animales que te rastrean por tu olor se les"
" hará más difícil hacerlo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Skilled Liar"
msgstr "Mentiroso/a Hábil"

#. ~ Description for Skilled Liar
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have no qualms about bending the truth, and have practically no tells.  "
"Telling lies and otherwise bluffing will be much easier for you."
msgstr ""
"No tienes ningún escrúpulo acerca de tergiversar la verdad, y sin que se "
"note. Decir mentiras y otros engaños será mucho más fácil para ti."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pretty"
msgstr "Guapo/a"

#. ~ Description for Pretty
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are a sight to behold.  NPCs who care about such things will react more "
"kindly to you."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bad Knees"
msgstr "Malas Rodillas"

#. ~ Description for Bad Knees
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Whether due to injury or age, your knees aren't particularly strong or "
"flexible.  Moving over rough terrain will slow you down more than normal."
msgstr ""
"Ya sea por una lesión o por la edad, tus rodillas no son particularmente "
"fuertes ni flexibles. Atravesar terreno duro te hace más lento, más que lo "
"normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Languorous"
msgstr "Lánguido/a"

#. ~ Description for Languorous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Whether due to lack of exercise and poor diet, or due to a natural "
"disinclination to physical endurance, you tire due to physical exertion much"
" more readily than others.  Your maximum stamina is 25% lower than usual."
msgstr ""
"Ya sea por la falta de ejercicio y mala alimentación, o debido a tu poca "
"disposición natural a la resistencia física, el esfuerzo físico te cansa "
"mucho más que a los demás. Tu máxima resistencia es un 25% menor que lo "
"normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Near-Sighted"
msgstr "Miope"

#. ~ Description for Near-Sighted
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Without glasses, your seeing radius is severely reduced!  However, you are "
"guaranteed to start with a pair of glasses."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Slow Healer"
msgstr "Sanador/a Lento/a"

#. ~ Description for Slow Healer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You heal a little slower than most; sleeping will heal less HP."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Poor Healer"
msgstr "Poco Sanador/a"

#. ~ Description for Poor Healer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your health recovery through sleeping is severely impaired and causes you to"
" recover only a third of usual HP."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Imperceptive Healer"
msgstr "Sanador/a Imperceptivo/a"

#. ~ Description for Imperceptive Healer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You recover barely any health through sleeping - it will heal only one tenth"
" of usual HP."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Far-Sighted"
msgstr "Hipermétrope"

#. ~ Description for Far-Sighted
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Without reading glasses, you are unable to read anything, and take penalties"
" on melee accuracy and electronics/tailoring crafting.  However, you are "
"guaranteed to start with a pair of reading glasses."
msgstr ""
"Sin tus gafas eres incapaz de leer y recibes penalidades a tu puntería en el"
" cuerpo a cuerpo y en la fabricación de electrónicos y en sastrería. Pero "
"empiezas con un par de gafas para leer."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Heavy Sleeper"
msgstr "Sueño pesado"

#. ~ Description for Heavy Sleeper
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You're quite the heavy sleeper.  Noises are unlikely to wake you up."
msgstr ""
"Eres uno de esos que tienen el sueño pesado. Los ruidos no te van a "
"despertar fácilmente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Sleepy"
msgstr "Soñoliento/a"

#. ~ Description for Sleepy
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You need sleep more often, but still spend most of your time awake."
msgstr ""
"Necesitas dormir más seguido, pero igual pasas la mayor parte del tiempo "
"despierto."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Asthmatic"
msgstr "Asmático/a"

#. ~ Description for Asthmatic
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You will occasionally need to use an inhaler, or else suffer severe physical"
" limitations.  However, you are guaranteed to start with an inhaler."
msgstr ""
"Ocasionalmente, necesitarás utilizar un inhalador o sino sufrirás severas "
"limitaciones físicas. Pero empiezas con un inhalador."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bad Back"
msgstr "Mala Espalda"

#. ~ Description for Bad Back
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You simply cannot carry as much as people with a similar strength could.  "
"Your maximum weight carried is reduced by 35%."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bad Temper"
msgstr "Mal Humor"

#. ~ Description for Bad Temper
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Things just keep getting you down.  You tend to be unhappy, and it takes "
"some doing to cheer you up."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas siempre te ponen mal. Tienes una tendencia a estar triste, y te "
"cuesta bastante levantar el ánimo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Disorganized"
msgstr "Desorganizado/a"

#. ~ Description for Disorganized
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are terrible at organizing and storing your possessions.  You can carry "
"40% less volume."
msgstr ""
"Eres terrible para organizar y guardar tus posesiones. Puedes cargar un 40% "
"menos de volumen."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Illiterate"
msgstr "Analfabeto/a"

#. ~ Description for Illiterate
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You never learned to read!  Books and computers are off-limits to you."
msgstr ""
"¡Nunca aprendiste a leer! Los libros y las computadoras están fuera de tus "
"posibilidades."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Poor Hearing"
msgstr "Mal Oído"

#. ~ Description for Poor Hearing
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your hearing is poor, and you may not hear quiet or far-off noises."
msgstr "Tu oído es malo, y no vas a escuchar los ruidos leves o distantes."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Slow Learner"
msgstr "Aprendiz Lento/a"

#. ~ Description for Slow Learner
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are slow to grasp new ideas and thus learn things more slowly than "
"others.  Note that this only applies to real-world experience, not to skill "
"gain from other sources like books."
msgstr ""
"Eres lento para incorporar nuevas ideas y entonces aprendes las cosas con "
"más lentitud que los demás. Esto solo se aplica para la experiencia "
"práctica, no para las habilidades aprendidas de libros y similares."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Insomniac"
msgstr "Insomne"

#. ~ Description for Insomniac
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a hard time falling asleep, even under the best circumstances!"
msgstr ""
"Te cuesta mucho dormirte, ¡incluso cuando las condiciones son perfectas!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Meat Intolerance"
msgstr "Intolerante a la Carne"

#. ~ Description for Meat Intolerance
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have problems with eating meat.  It's possible for you to eat it, but "
"you will suffer morale penalties due to nausea."
msgstr ""
"Tienes problemas para comer carne. Puedes comerla, pero vas a sufrir "
"penalidades a tu moral debido a las náuseas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Thin-Skinned"
msgstr "Piel Fina"

#. ~ Description for Thin-Skinned
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your skin is fragile.  Cutting damage is slightly increased for you."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel es frágil. El daño cortante que sufres se incrementa levemente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hates Vegetables"
msgstr "Odio a las Verduras"

#. ~ Description for Hates Vegetables
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You, like many children, hated eating your vegetables; however, you didn't "
"outgrow it.  It's possible for you to eat them, but you will suffer morale "
"penalties due to nausea."
msgstr ""
"Tú, como la mayoría de los chicos, odias comerte tus verduras. Sin embargo, "
"nunca maduraste. Puedes comerlas, pero vas a sufrir penalidades a tu moral "
"debido a las náuseas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hates Books"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Hates Books
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Reading is for nerds!  Boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun "
"by reading books."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hates Fruit"
msgstr "Odio a las Frutas"

#. ~ Description for Hates Fruit
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You despise eating fruits.  It's possible for you to eat them, but you will "
"suffer morale penalties due to nausea."
msgstr ""
"Desprecias comer frutas. Las puedes comer, pero vas a sufrir penalidades a "
"tu moral debido a las náuseas."

#. ~ Description for Lactose Intolerance
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You, like 75 percent of the world, cannot tolerate milk or milk-based "
"products.  It's possible for you to eat them, but you will suffer morale "
"penalties due to nausea."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Junkfood Intolerance"
msgstr "Intolerancia Comida Basura"

#. ~ Description for Junkfood Intolerance
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Something in those heavily processed foods doesn't agree with you.  It's "
"possible for you to eat them, but you will suffer morale penalties due to "
"nausea."
msgstr ""
"Algo de esa comida excesivamente procesada, no se lleva bien contigo. Puedes"
" comerla igual, pero vas a sufrir penalidades a tu moral debido a las "
"náuseas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Grain Intolerance"
msgstr "Intolerancia al grano"

#. ~ Description for Grain Intolerance
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a rare allergy that prevents you from eating most types of grains "
"such as wheat or oats.  It's possible for you to eat them, but you will "
"suffer morale penalties due to nausea."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Sweet Tooth"
msgstr "Goloso/a"

#. ~ Description for Sweet Tooth
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a soft spot for processed foods, and gain a morale bonus from "
"eating them."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Sugar-Loving"
msgstr "Amante-del-Azúcar"

#. ~ Description for Sugar-Loving
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You *adore* the taste of junk food, and find it preferable to everything "
"else!"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Glass Jaw"
msgstr "Mandíbula de Cristal"

#. ~ Description for Glass Jaw
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your head can't take much abuse.  Its maximum HP is 20% lower than usual."
msgstr ""
"Tu cabeza no puede soportar demasiados golpes. Tus máximos PV de esa parte "
"de tu cuerpo es un 20% menos que lo normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Forgetful"
msgstr "Olvidadizo/a"

#. ~ Description for Forgetful
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a hard time remembering things.  Your skills will erode slightly "
"faster than usual, and you can remember less terrain."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Lightweight"
msgstr "Ligero/a"

#. ~ Description for Lightweight
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Alcohol and drugs go straight to your head.  You suffer the negative effects"
" of these for longer."
msgstr ""
"Las drogas y el alcohol se te van derechito a la cabeza. Sufres los efectos "
"negativos de estas cosas por más tiempo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Addictive Personality"
msgstr "Personalidad Adictiva"

#. ~ Description for Addictive Personality
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's easier for you to become addicted to substances, and harder to rid "
"yourself of these addictions."
msgstr ""
"Es más fácil para ti volverte adicto a las sustancias, y más difícil "
"deshacerte de esas adicciones."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Trigger Happy"
msgstr "Gatillo Fácil"

#. ~ Description for Trigger Happy
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"On rare occasion, you will go full-auto when you intended to fire a single "
"shot.  This has no effect when firing semi-automatic firearms."
msgstr ""
"En algunas ocasiones, vas a disparar en automático cuando quieras disparar "
"un solo tiro. Esto no tiene efecto cuando usas armas semi-automáticas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Strong Scent"
msgstr "Mucho Olor"

#. ~ Description for Strong Scent
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your scent is particularly strong.  It's not offensive to humans, but "
"animals that track your scent will do so more easily."
msgstr ""
"Tu olor es bastante fuerte. No es ofensivo para los otros humanos, pero a "
"los animales que te rastrean por tu olor se les hará más fácil."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Chemical Imbalance"
msgstr "Desequilibrio Químico"

#. ~ Description for Chemical Imbalance
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You suffer from a minor chemical imbalance, whether mental or physical.  "
"Minor changes to your internal chemistry will manifest themselves on "
"occasion, such as hunger, sleepiness, narcotic effects, etc."
msgstr ""
"Sufres un pequeño desequilibrio químico, ya sea mental o físico. Los "
"pequeños cambios en tu química interior se manifestarán ocasionalmente, como"
" el hambre, el sueño, los efectos narcóticos, etc."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Animal Discord"
msgstr "Antipatía Animal"

#. ~ Description for Animal Discord
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Most animals don't like you, and aggressive animals are more likely to "
"attack you.  This only applies to natural animals such as woodland "
"creatures."
msgstr ""
"Le caes mal a la mayoría de los animales, y los que son agresivos serán más "
"propensos a atacarte. Esto solo se aplica a los animales naturales como las "
"criaturas del bosque."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Prey Animal"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Prey Animal
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Natural animals like dogs and wolves see you as prey, and are liable to "
"attack you on sight."
msgstr ""
"Los animales naturales como los perros y los lobos te ven como una presa, y "
"son más propensos a atacarte a simple vista."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Slow Reader"
msgstr "Lector/a Lento/a"

#. ~ Description for Slow Reader
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're a slow reader, and it takes you longer to get through books than "
"most."
msgstr ""
"Eres lento para leer, te lleva más tiempo que a los demás terminar un libro."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Schizophrenic"
msgstr "Esquizofrénico/a"

#. ~ Description for Schizophrenic
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You will periodically suffer from delusions, ranging from minor effects to "
"full visual hallucinations.  Some of these effects may be controlled through"
" the use of Thorazine."
msgstr ""
"Periódicamente, sufrirás alucinaciones, oscilando entre efectos leves hasta "
"ilusiones visuales completas. Algunos de estos efectos pueden ser "
"controlados con la droga Thorazine."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Narcoleptic"
msgstr "Narcoléptico"

#. ~ Description for Narcoleptic
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You randomly fall asleep without any reason."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Clumsy"
msgstr "Torpe"

#. ~ Description for Clumsy
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You make more noise while walking.  You're also more likely to set off "
"traps."
msgstr ""
"Haces más ruido cuando caminas. También eres más propenso a caer en trampas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Jittery"
msgstr "Tembleque"

#. ~ Description for Jittery
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"During moments of great stress or under the effects of stimulants, you may "
"find your hands shaking uncontrollably, severely reducing your Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"En los momentos de mucho estrés o bajo los efectos de estimulantes, vas a "
"ver que tus manos tiemblan incontrolablemente, lo que reduce severamente tu "
"Destreza."

#. ~ Description for Hoarder
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You don't feel right unless you're carrying as much as you can.  You suffer "
"morale penalties for carrying less than maximum volume (weight is ignored)."
"  Xanax can help control this anxiety."
msgstr ""
"No te vas a sentir bien a menos que estés cargando tanto como puedas. Sufres"
" penalidades a la moral si cargas menos del máximo volumen que puedes llevar"
" (el peso no importa). El Xanax te puede ayudar a controlar esta ansiedad."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Savant"
msgstr "Erudito/a"

#. ~ Description for Savant
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You tend to specialize in one skill and be poor at all others.  You advance "
"at half speed in all skills except your best one.  Note that combining this "
"with Fast Learner will come out to a slower rate of learning for all skills."
msgstr ""
"Te especializas en una habilidad y eres peor en todas las demás. Avanzas a "
"media velocidad en todas las excepto en la mejor que tengas. Combinado con "
"Aprendiz Rápido resulta en un aprendizaje más lento para todas las "
"habilidades."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pacifist"
msgstr "Pacifista"

#. ~ Description for Pacifist
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You don't like thinking about violence.  Your combat skills advance much "
"slower than usual, and you feel more guilt about killing."
msgstr ""
"No te gusta pensar en la violencia. Tus habilidades de combate avanzan mucho"
" más lento que lo normal, y te sientes más culpable cuando matas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mood Swings"
msgstr "Cambios de Humor"

#. ~ Description for Mood Swings
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your morale will shift up and down at random, often dramatically."
msgstr "Tu moral sube y baja al azar, a veces dramáticamente. "

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Slow Footed"
msgstr "Pies Lentos"

#. ~ Description for Slow Footed
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You can't move as fast as most, resulting in a 15% speed penalty on flat "
"ground."
msgstr ""
"No te puedes movar tan rápido como los demas. Tenes una penalización de 15% "
"en suelo plano."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Weak Stomach"
msgstr "Estómago Flojo"

#. ~ Description for Weak Stomach
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You are more likely to throw up from food poisoning, alcohol, etc."
msgstr ""
"Eres más propenso a vomitar por intoxicación con la comida, el alcohol, etc."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Wool Allergy"
msgstr "Alergia a la Lana"

#. ~ Description for Wool Allergy
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are badly allergic to wool, and cannot wear any clothing made of the "
"substance."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Truth Teller"
msgstr "Honesto/a"

#. ~ Description for Truth Teller
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"When you try to tell a lie, you blush, stammer, and get all shifty-eyed.  "
"Telling lies and otherwise bluffing will be much more difficult for you."
msgstr ""
"Cuando tratas de decir una mentira, te colocas colorado, tartamudeas y "
"pareces sospechoso. Para ti, es mucho más difícil decir mentiras y otros "
"engaños."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Ugly"
msgstr "Feo/a"

#. ~ Description for Ugly
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're not much to look at.  NPCs who care about such things will react "
"poorly to you."
msgstr ""
"No eres algo que dan ganas de mirar. Los PNJ que se interesen en las "
"apariencias te van a tratar con desprecio."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Albino"
msgstr "Albino/a"

#. ~ Description for Albino
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You lack skin pigmentation due to a genetic problem.  You sunburn extremely "
"easily, and typically use an umbrella and sunglasses when going out in the "
"sun."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Flimsy"
msgstr "Endeble"

#. ~ Description for Flimsy
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your body can't take much abuse.  Its maximum HP is 25% lower than usual and"
" you heal slightly slower.  Stacks with Glass Jaw."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo no puede soportar demasiados golpes. Tus máximos PV son un 25% "
"menor que lo usual, y te curas un poco más lento. Es acumulativo con "
"Mandíbula de Cristal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Frail"
msgstr "Delicado/a"

#. ~ Description for Frail
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your body breaks very easily.  Its maximum HP is 50% lower than usual and "
"you heal slower.  Stacks with Glass Jaw."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo se rompe fácilmente. Tus máximos PV son un 50% menor que lo usual,"
" y te curas más lento. Es acumulativo con Mandíbula de Cristal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fragile"
msgstr "Frágil"

#. ~ Description for Fragile
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your body is extremely fragile.  Its maximum HP is 75% lower than usual and "
"you heal much slower.  Stacks with Glass Jaw."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo es extremadamente frágil. Tus máximos PV son un 75% menor que lo "
"usual, y te curas mucho más lento. Es acumulativo con Mandíbula de Cristal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Genetic Downward Spiral"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Genetic Downward Spiral
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The events of the Cataclysm have damaged your DNA beyond repair.  You mutate"
" frequently, and all mutations you receive (from any source) are negative."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Rough Skin"
msgstr "Piel Dura"

#. ~ Description for Rough Skin
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your skin is slightly rough.  This has no gameplay effect."
msgstr "Tu piel es un poco más dura. Esto no tiene ningún efecto."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "High Night Vision"
msgstr "Visión Nocturna Aguda"

#. ~ Description for High Night Vision
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can see incredibly well in the dark!  Activate to toggle NV-visible "
"areas on or off."
msgstr ""
"¡Puedes ver increíblemente bien en la oscuridad! Hay que activarlo para ver "
"las áreas visibles por Visión Nocturna."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Full Night Vision"
msgstr "Visión Nocturna Completa"

#. ~ Description for Full Night Vision
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can see in pitch blackness as if you were wearing night-vision goggles."
"  Activate to toggle NV-visible areas on or off."
msgstr ""
"En la oscuridad total puedes ver como si estuvieras usando gafas de visión "
"nocturna. Hay que activarlo para ver las áreas visibles por Visión Nocturna."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Cephalopod Eyes"
msgstr "Ojos de Cefalópodo"

#. ~ Description for Cephalopod Eyes
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes still bulge, yet your pupils look different somehow.  Water "
"doesn't seem to cause any trouble at all, though."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Cephalopod Vision"
msgstr "Visión de Cefalópodo"

#. ~ Description for Cephalopod Vision
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your brain has caught up with your eyes.  You can see much better in the "
"dark, but sunlight seems much brighter now.  Activate to toggle NV-visible "
"areas on or off."
msgstr ""
"Tu cerebro ahora acompaña la capacidad de tus ojos. Puedes ver mucho mejor "
"en la oscuridad, pero la luz del sol parece mucho más brillante. Hay que "
"activarlo para ver las áreas visibles por Visión Nocturna."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fey Eyes"
msgstr "Ojos de Fey"

#. ~ Description for Fey Eyes
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes have turned...green.  It's tough to tell the exact shade as it "
"seems to shift.  The effect is ...pleasant."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos se han vuelto... verdes. Es difícil decir exactamente de qué matiz "
"son porque parecen cambiar. El efecto es... placentero."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fey Vision"
msgstr "Visión de Fey"

#. ~ Description for Fey Vision
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shadows don't seem as dark now.  Activate to toggle NV-visible areas on "
"or off."
msgstr ""
"Las sombras ya no parecen ser tan oscuras. Hay que activarlo para ver las "
"áreas visibles por Visión Nocturna."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fey Nightsight"
msgstr "Visión Nocturna de Fey"

#. ~ Description for Fey Nightsight
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have great low-light vision now, though that doesn't allow you to "
"perform fine tasks such as crafting and reading in darkness.  Activate to "
"toggle NV-visible areas on or off."
msgstr ""
"Ahora tienes muy buena visión con poca luz, aunque eso no te permite "
"realizar acciones como fabricar o leer en la oscuridad. Hay que activarla "
"para encender y apagar las áreas visibles por Visión Nocturna."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Feline Eyes"
msgstr "Ojos Felinos"

#. ~ Description for Feline Eyes
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes have mutated, now having a slitted pupil and glittering in light, "
"much like those of cats.  This is visually striking, but it isn't helping "
"you see at night."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos han mutado, ahora tienen la pupila rasgada y brillan en la luz, muy"
" similar a los de los gatos. Esto es llamativo, pero no te ayuda a ver en la"
" noche."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Feline Vision"
msgstr "Visión Felina"

#. ~ Description for Feline Vision
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your optic nerves and brain caught up with your eyes.  Now you can see "
"pretty well at night.  Activate to toggle NV-visible areas on or off."
msgstr ""
"Tus nervios ópticos ahora acompañan la capacidad de tus ojos. Puedes ver "
"bastante bien en la noche. Hay que activarlo para ver las áreas visibles por"
" Visión Nocturna."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Ursine Vision"
msgstr "Visión ursina"

#. ~ Description for Ursine Vision
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your visual processing has shifted: though you can see better in the dark, "
"you're nearsighted in the light.  Maybe glasses would help.  Activate to "
"toggle NV-visible areas on or off."
msgstr ""
"Tu proceso visual ha cambiado: a pesar de que puedes ver mejor en la "
"oscuridad, eres miope cuando hay luz. Tal vez las gafas te puedan ayudar. "
"Hay que activarlo para ver las áreas visibles por Visión Nocturna."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Avian Eyes"
msgstr "Ojos Aviarios"

#. ~ Description for Avian Eyes
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your vision has become particularly acute: you suspect you could pick out "
"zombies much farther away.  Perception +4."
msgstr ""
"Tu visión se ha vuelto particularmente aguda: sospechas que puedes divisar "
"zombis desde mucho más lejos. Percepción +4."

#. ~ Description for Infrared Vision
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your eyes have mutated to pick up radiation in the infrared spectrum."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos han mutado y puedes ver la radiación en el espectro infrarrojo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Reptilian Eyes"
msgstr "Ojos Reptilianos"

#. ~ Description for Reptilian Eyes
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes have mutated, with a brilliant iris and slitted pupil similar to "
"that of a lizard.  This is visually striking, but doesn't seem to affect "
"your vision."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos han mutado, con un iris brillante y la pupila rasgada, similar a "
"los de un lagarto. Esto es llamativo, pero no parece afectar tu visión."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Reptilian IR"
msgstr "IR Reptiliano"

#. ~ Description for Reptilian IR
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your optic nerves and brain have mutated to catch up with your eyes, "
"allowing you to see in the infrared spectrum."
msgstr ""
"Tus nervios ópticos y cerebro han mutado para acompañar la capacidad de tus "
"ojos, lo que te permite ver en el espectro infrarrojo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Fast Healer"
msgstr "Sanador Muy Rápido"

#. ~ Description for Very Fast Healer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your flesh regenerates slowly, and you will regain HP even when not "
"sleeping."
msgstr ""
"Tu carne se regenera lentamente, y vas a recuperar PV incluso sin estar "
"durmiendo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Regeneration"
msgstr "Regeneración"

#. ~ Description for Regeneration
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your flesh regenerates from wounds incredibly quickly."
msgstr "Tu carne se regenera de sus heridas increíblemente rápido."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Reptilian Healing"
msgstr "Sanador Reptiliano"

#. ~ Description for Reptilian Healing
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your broken limbs mend themselves without significant difficulty."
msgstr "Tus miembros rotos se curan solos sin mucha dificultad."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Little Sleep"
msgstr "Muy poco Sueño"

#. ~ Description for Very Little Sleep
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You don't sleep often.  But when you do, you need very little of it."
msgstr ""
"No duermes muy seguido. Pero cuando duermes, con muy poco es suficiente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tireless"
msgstr "Incansable"

#. ~ Description for Tireless
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You defend the realm all night and all day."
msgstr "Defiendes el reino toda la noche y todo el día."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fangs"
msgstr "Colmillos"

#. ~ Description for Fangs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your teeth have grown into two-inch-long fangs, allowing you to make an "
"extra attack when conditions favor it."
msgstr ""
"Tus dientes se han convertido en colmillos de 5 centímetros, lo que te "
"permite tener un ataque extra cuando las condiciones te lo permiten."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You sink your fangs into %s"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s sinks their fangs into %2$s"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Incisors"
msgstr "Incisivos"

#. ~ Description for Incisors
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your big teeth have grown in.  Folks had best show some more respect."
msgstr ""
"Tus dientes grandes han crecido. La gente te va a tener que respetar más."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You bite into %s with your ratlike incisors"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s bites %2$s with their ratlike incisors"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Nictitating Membrane"
msgstr "Membrana Nictitante"

#. ~ Description for Nictitating Membrane
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a set of clear lenses which lower over your eyes while underwater, "
"allowing you to see as though you were wearing goggles.  Slightly decreases "
"wet penalties."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Gills"
msgstr "Branquias"

#. ~ Description for Gills
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've grown a set of gills in your neck, allowing you to breathe "
"underwater.  Slightly increases wet benefits."
msgstr ""
"Te han crecido unas branquias en tu cuello, lo que te permite respirar bajo "
"el agua. Incrementa levemente los beneficios de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Cephalopod Gills"
msgstr "Branquias de Cefalópodo"

#. ~ Description for Cephalopod Gills
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've grown a set of gills, running from your neck up behind your ears.  "
"They allow you to breathe underwater and slightly increase wet benefits."
msgstr ""
"Te han crecido unas branquias a lo largo de tu cuello hasta detras de las "
"orejas. Te permiten respirar abajo del agua y incrementa levemente los "
"beneficios de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycus Flesh"
msgstr "Carne de Mycus"

#. ~ Description for Mycus Flesh
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We have begun adapting local physiology to Mycus physical structure, greatly"
" reducing wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Nosotros hemos comenzado a adaptar la fisiología local hacia la estructura "
"física Mycis, reduciendo mucho los efectos de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycus Fireproofing"
msgstr "Ignifuguez de Mycus"

#. ~ Description for Mycus Fireproofing
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We have spliced the dense, amphibole fibers from Mycus core towers with the "
"resilient, adaptive flesh of local physiology.  This reduces our speed by a "
"moderate amount, but provides powerful armor across our body, nullifies wet "
"effects, and provides complete protection from fire."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycogenesis"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Mycogenesis
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Local physiology has been fully incorporated with that of Mycus silicate "
"fibers.  In addition to benefits conferred by previous developments, we may "
"join with Mycus fibers beneath us - sleeping on top of fungal areas places "
"us into a dormant state, which spreads spores around us as we sleep and "
"revitalizes our body much more quickly than regular sleep."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Scales"
msgstr "Escamas"

#. ~ Description for Scales
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of flexible green scales has grown to cover your body, acting as "
"natural armor.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de escamas verdes y flexibles te han crecido y cubren tu "
"cuerpo. Funcionan como una armadura natural. De alguna manera, disminuyen "
"los efectos de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Thick Scales"
msgstr "Escamas Gruesas"

#. ~ Description for Thick Scales
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of heavy green scales has grown to cover your body, acting as natural "
"armor.  While difficult to penetrate, it also limits your flexibility, "
"resulting in a -2 penalty to Dexterity.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de escamas verdes y resistentes te han crecido y cubren tu "
"cuerpo. Funcionan como una armadura natural. Aunque es difícil de penetrar, "
"también limita tu flexibilidad, lo que te da una penalización de -2 a tu "
"destreza. Reduce mucho los efectos de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Sleek Scales"
msgstr "Escamas Lisas"

#. ~ Description for Sleek Scales
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of very flexible and slick scales has grown to cover your body.  These"
" act as weak natural armor, improve your ability to swim, and make you "
"difficult to grab.  Mostly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de escamas muy flexibles y lisas te han crecido y cubren tu "
"cuerpo. Estas actúan como una débil armadura natural, mejoran tu habilidad "
"para nadar, y hacen que sea más difícil agarrarte. Reduce mucho los efectos "
"de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Light Bones"
msgstr "Huesos Livianos"

#. ~ Description for Light Bones
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your bones are very light.  This enables you to move and attack 10% faster, "
"but also reduces your carrying weight by 20% and makes bashing attacks hurt "
"a little more."
msgstr ""
"Tus huesos son muy livianos. Esto te permite moverte y atacar un 10% más "
"rápido, pero también reduce tu capacidad de cargar peso en un 20%, y hace "
"que los ataques golpeantes duelan un poco más."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Feathers"
msgstr "Plumas"

#. ~ Description for Feathers
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Iridescent feathers have grown to cover your entire body, providing a "
"marginal protection against attacks and minor protection from cold.  They "
"also provide a natural waterproofing."
msgstr ""
"Plumas iridiscentes han crecido y cubren tu cuerpo entero, lo que te brinda "
"una protección mínima contra los ataques y un poco de protección al frío. "
"También son un impermeable natural."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Down"
msgstr "Plumones"

#. ~ Description for Down
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You shan't need to migrate south with your layer of down.  It's even better "
"with no apes around to kill you for it!"
msgstr ""
"No vas a necesitar migrar al sur con tu capa de plumones. Todavía es mejor "
"porque ¡no hay simios por ahí tratando de matarte para quitártelas!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Lightly Furred"
msgstr "Pelaje Ligero"

#. ~ Description for Lightly Furred
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Light fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing slight protection "
"from cold."
msgstr ""
"Un pelaje ligero ha crecido y cubre tu cuerpo entero, lo que te brinda una "
"pequeña protección contra el frío."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Furry"
msgstr "Peludo/a"

#. ~ Description for Furry
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Thick black fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing a marginal "
"protection against attacks, and considerable protection from cold."
msgstr ""
"Te ha crecido pelo negro y grueso que cubre todo tu cuerpo, lo que te brinda"
" una mínima protección contra los ataques, y una protección considerable "
"contra el frío."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Shaggy Fur"
msgstr "Pelaje Largo"

#. ~ Description for Shaggy Fur
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your fur has grown out and thickened, providing noticeable protection from "
"attacks as well as considerable insulation."
msgstr ""
"Tu pelaje ha crecido y se ha endurecido, lo que te brinda una evidente "
"protección contra los ataques, así como también un aislamiento térmico "
"considerable."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Gray Fur"
msgstr "Pelaje Gris"

#. ~ Description for Gray Fur
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Dense gray fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing a marginal "
"protection against attacks, and considerable protection from cold."
msgstr ""
"Es un pelaje denso y gris te ha crecido y cubre todo tu cuerpo, lo que te "
"brinda una mínima protección contra los ataques, y una protección "
"considerable contra el frío."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Sleek Fur"
msgstr "Pelaje Liso"

#. ~ Description for Sleek Fur
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You've grown sleek brown fur, providing some protection from cold."
msgstr ""
"Te ha crecido un pelaje marrón y liso, lo que te brinda algo de protección "
"contra el frío."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Lynx Fur"
msgstr "Pelaje de Lince"

#. ~ Description for Lynx Fur
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your fur has grown out significantly around your cheeks and neck.  It "
"provides minor protection against attacks."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Chitinous Skin"
msgstr "Piel Quitinosa"

#. ~ Description for Chitinous Skin
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your epidermis has turned into a thin, flexible layer of chitin.  It "
"provides minor protection from cutting wounds.  Slightly reduces wet "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Tu epidermis se ha convertido en una capa de quitina delgada y flexible. Te "
"brinda una protección menor al daño cortante. Y reduce un poco los efectos "
"de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Chitinous Armor"
msgstr "Armadura Quitinosa"

#. ~ Description for Chitinous Armor
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've grown a chitin exoskeleton, much like that of an insect.  It provides"
" considerable physical protection, but reduces your Dexterity by 1.  "
"Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Chitinous Plate"
msgstr "Coraza Quitinosa"

#. ~ Description for Chitinous Plate
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've grown a chitin exoskeleton made of thick, stiff plates.  It provides "
"excellent physical protection, but reduces your Dexterity by 1 and encumbers"
" all body parts but your eyes and mouth.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hairy Chitin"
msgstr "Quitina con Pelaje"

#. ~ Description for Hairy Chitin
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've developed some sort of hair growing out of your chitin.  It's a bit "
"warmer than not having hair."
msgstr ""
"Has desarrollado alguna especie de pelo que crece de tu capa de quitina. Es "
"un poco más abrigado que no tener pelo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Furred Chitin"
msgstr "Quitina Peluda"

#. ~ Description for Furred Chitin
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your chitin hair has thickened and spread across your body.  It provides "
"minor warmth and helps you sense nearby vibrations."
msgstr ""
"El pelo que crece de tu capa de quitina se ha engrosado y extendido por todo"
" tu cuerpo. Te brinda un poco de abrigo y te ayuda a percibir vibraciones "
"cercanas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Furred Plate"
msgstr "Coraza Peluda"

#. ~ Description for Furred Plate
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your exoskeleton has hardened considerably--restricting movement, granted--"
"and boasts a fine coat of hairs that put feline whiskers to shame."
msgstr ""
"Tu exoesqueleto se ha endurecido considerablemente, lo que reduce tu "
"movimiento, y presume de un buen abrigo de pelos que hacen pasar vergüenza a"
" los bigotes de los gatos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Urticating Hairs"
msgstr "Pelos Urticantes"

#. ~ Description for Urticating Hairs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Significant amounts of your hairs have loosened.  If some creature tries to "
"attack you, your assailant is quite likely to get fine, bristly chitin in an"
" irritating spot; it doesn't carry your venom but it will be distracting."
msgstr ""
"Cantidades significativas de pelo se te han aflojado. Si alguna criatura "
"intenta atacarte, es bastante probable que tu agresor reciba una buena "
"quitina rasposa en un lugar molesto. No tiene tu veneno pero es una buena "
"distracción."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Spines"
msgstr "Pinchos"

#. ~ Description for Spines
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skin is covered with fine spines.  Whenever an unarmed opponent strikes"
" a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will receive "
"moderate damage."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel está cubierta con pinchos finos. Cada vez que un oponente desarmado "
"golpea una parte de tu cuerpo que no está cubierta, va a recibir un daño "
"moderado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Quills"
msgstr "Púas"

#. ~ Description for Quills
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body is covered with large quills.  Whenever an unarmed opponent "
"strikes a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will "
"receive significant damage."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo está cubierto con grandes púas. Cada vez que un oponente desarmado"
" golpea una parte de tu cuerpo que no está cubierta, va a recibir un daño "
"significativo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Phelloderm"
msgstr "Felodermis"

#. ~ Description for Phelloderm
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skin is light green and has a slightly woody quality to it.  This "
"provides a weak armor, and helps you retain moisture, resulting in less "
"thirst.  Greatly decreases wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel es ligeramente verdosa y tiene una pequeña similitud con la madera. "
"Esto te brinda una armadura débil, y te ayuda a mantener la humedad, lo que "
"significa menos sed. Disminuye mucho las penalidades por estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bark"
msgstr "Corteza"

#. ~ Description for Bark
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skin is coated in a light bark, like that of a tree.  This provides "
"resistance to cutting damage and minor protection from fire.  Greatly "
"reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel está revestida con una fina corteza, como la de un árbol. Esto te "
"brinda resistencia al daño cortante, y una protección menor al fuego. Reduce"
" mucho las penalidades por estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Thorns"
msgstr "Espinas"

#. ~ Description for Thorns
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skin is covered in small, woody thorns.  Whenever an unarmed opponent "
"strikes a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will "
"receive minor damage.  Your punches may also deal extra damage."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel está cubierta con pequeñas espinas de madera. Cada vez que un "
"oponente desarmado golpea una parte de tu cuerpo que no está cubierta, va a "
"recibir un daño menor. Tus trompadas también causan daño extra."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Leaves"
msgstr "Hojas"

#. ~ Description for Leaves
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"All the hair on your body has turned to long, grass-like leaves.  Apart from"
" being physically striking, these provide you with a minor amount of "
"nutrition while in sunlight.  Slightly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Todo el pelo de tu cuerpo se ha convertido en unas hojas largas como hierba."
" Además de ser llamativo, te brinda una pequeña cuota de nutrición mientras "
"estás al sol. Reduce un poco los efectos de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Flowering"
msgstr "Floreciente"

#. ~ Description for Flowering
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've started blooming where your scalp used to be.  Your blossoms have a "
"pleasant aroma, are visually striking, and are quite sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Donde antes estaba tu cuero cabelludo, ahora empezaste a florecer. Tus "
"flores tienen un aroma agradable, son llamativos y bastante sensitivos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycus Spores"
msgstr "Esporas de Mycus"

#. ~ Description for Mycus Spores
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "We have developed local spore sacs.  The Mycus must grow."
msgstr ""
"Nosotros hemos desarrollado sacos locales de esporas. El Mycus debe crecer."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycus Sporogenesis"
msgstr "Esporogénesis de Mycus"

#. ~ Description for Mycus Sporogenesis
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Local organisms seem to regard open spore-dispersal as a danger, and attack "
"the Mycus.  Accordingly our local spore sacs remain quiescent, until local "
"guidance determines that it is safe to germinate.  Rapid development taxes "
"local nutrient reserves but ensures swift and effective growth."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycus Blossoms"
msgstr "Capullos de Mycus"

#. ~ Description for Mycus Blossoms
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "We have developed local blossoms.  The Mycus must grow."
msgstr "Nosotros hemos desarrollado capullos locales. El Mycus debe crecer."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycus Bloom"
msgstr "Floración de Mycus"

#. ~ Description for Mycus Bloom
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Local organisms seem to regard open spore-dispersal as a danger, and attack "
"the Mycus.  Accordingly our local blossoms remain quiescent, until local "
"guidance determines that it is safe to germinate.  Rapid development taxes "
"local nutrient reserves but ensures swift and effective growth."
msgstr ""
"Organismos locales parecen considerar la dispersión de esporas como peligro,"
" y atacan a los Mycus. En consecuencia, nuestros capullos locales se "
"mantienen inactivos hasta que una orden local determina que es seguro "
"germinar. El desarrollo rápido exprime las reservas locales de nutrientes, "
"pero asegura el crecimiento rápido y efectivo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycus Provenance"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Mycus Provenance
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Local spore sacs and blossoms have merged into a single, symbiotic form.  "
"Acting as one, they germinate together to cement rapid growth across a large"
" area according to local guidance.  The Mycus must grow."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Long Fingernails"
msgstr "Uñas Largas"

#. ~ Description for Long Fingernails
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your fingernails are long and sharp.  If you aren't wearing gloves, your "
"unarmed attacks deal a minor amount of cutting damage."
msgstr ""
"Tus uñas son largas y afiladas. Si no tienes puestos guantes, tus ataques "
"desarmados causan un daño cortante menor."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Claws"
msgstr "Garras"

#. ~ Description for Claws
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have claws on the ends of your fingers.  If you aren't wearing gloves, "
"your unarmed attacks deal a minor amount of cutting damage."
msgstr ""
"Tienes garras en la punta de tus dedos. Si no tienes puestos guantes, tus "
"ataques desarmados causan un daño cortante menor."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Rat Claws"
msgstr "Garras de Rata"

#. ~ Description for Rat Claws
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your claws have grown tougher and slightly gnarled."
msgstr "Tus garras han crecido y son más duras y un poco retorcidas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Stainless Claws"
msgstr "Garras Inoxidables"

#. ~ Description for Stainless Claws
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your paws are bone, muscle, and claw with a thin layer of skin and fur.  "
"They might as well be made of stainless steel."
msgstr ""
"Tus patas están hechas de hueso, músculo y garras con una pequeña capa de "
"piel y pelo. Como si fueran de acero inoxidable."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Retractable Claws"
msgstr "Garras Retraíbles"

#. ~ Description for Retractable Claws
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have claws on the ends of your fingers, and can extend or retract them "
"as desired.  Gloves will still get in the way, though."
msgstr ""
"Tienes garras en la punta de tus dedos, y las puedes extender o retraer "
"cuando quieras. Igual, los guantes van a ser un obstáculo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tentacle Rakes"
msgstr "Tentáculos Rastrillo"

#. ~ Description for Tentacle Rakes
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your upper tentacles have grown large, hook-barbed rakes on the ends.  "
"They're quite vicious, but really aren't suited for fine manipulation."
msgstr ""
"Tus tentáculos superiores han desarrollado en la punta, como unos ganchos "
"largos. Parecen bastante feroces, pero no son adecuados para la motricidad "
"fina."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Large Talons"
msgstr "Zarpas Grandes"

#. ~ Description for Large Talons
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your index fingers have grown into huge talons.  After a bit of practice, "
"you find that this does not affect your dexterity, but allows for a deadly "
"unarmed attack.  They also prevent wearing gloves."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Radiogenic"
msgstr "Radiogénico/a"

#. ~ Description for Radiogenic
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your system has adapted to radiation.  While irradiated, you will actually "
"heal slowly, converting the radiation into hit points."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema se ha adaptado a la radiación. Mientras estás irradiado, sanarás "
"lentamente convirtiendo la radiación en puntos de vida."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Marloss Carrier"
msgstr "Cargador/a de Marloss"

#. ~ Description for Marloss Carrier
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ever since you ate that Marloss berry, you can't get its scent out of your "
"nose, and you have a strong desire to try some seeds and...sap?"
msgstr ""
"Desde que comiste esas bayas Marloss, no te puedes sacar su olor de la "
"nariz, y tienes como un fuerte deseo de probar semillas y... ¿savia?"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Marloss Vessel"
msgstr "Recipiente de Marloss"

#. ~ Description for Marloss Vessel
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ever since you ate that Marloss seed, you can't get its taste off of your "
"tongue, and you have a strong desire to try some berries and...sap?"
msgstr ""
"Desde que comiste esas semillas de Marloss, no te puedes sacar su gusto de "
"la lengua, y tienes como un fuerte deseo de probar unas bayas y... ¿savia?"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Marloss Vector"
msgstr "Portador/a de Marloss"

#. ~ Description for Marloss Vector
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ever since you ate that Marloss jelly, you can't stop thinking of it, and "
"you have a strong desire to eat some seeds and berries."
msgstr ""
"Desde que comiste esa gelatina de Marloss, no puedes dejar de pensar en "
"ella, y tienes como un fuerte deseo de comer semillas y bayas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Marloss Rejection"
msgstr "Rechazo al Marloss"

#. ~ Description for Marloss Rejection
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ever since you had that life-threatening reaction to that Marloss junk, you "
"can't bear the thought of ever eating it again!"
msgstr ""
"Desde que tuviste la reacción que casi te mata a esa porquería de Marloss, "
"¡no puedes soportar el pensamiento de volver a comerlo!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mutagenic Aversion"
msgstr "Aversión al Mutágeno"

#. ~ Description for Mutagenic Aversion
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ever since you had that life-threatening reaction to those mutagen and "
"purifier things, you can't bear the thought of ever using them again!"
msgstr ""
"Desde que tuviste la reacción que casi te mata a ese mutágeno y ese "
"purificador, ¡no puedes soportar el pensamiento de volver a usarlos!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Insect Pheromones"
msgstr "Feromonas de Insecto"

#. ~ Description for Insect Pheromones
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body produces low-level pheromones, identifying you as a friend to many"
" species of insects.  Insects will attack you much less."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo produce feromonas de bajo nivel, lo que te identifica como amigo "
"de varias especies de insectos. Los insectos te atacarán mucho menos que "
"antes."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mammal Pheromones"
msgstr "Feromonas de Mamífero"

#. ~ Description for Mammal Pheromones
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body produces low-level pheromones which put mammals at ease.  They "
"will be less likely to attack or flee from you."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Disease Immune"
msgstr "Inmune a la Enfermedad"

#. ~ Description for Disease Immune
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body is simply immune to diseases.  You will never catch an ambient "
"disease."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo es inmune a las enfermedades. Nunca te agarrarás una enfermedad "
"ambiental."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Infection Resistant"
msgstr "Resistir Infección"

#. ~ Description for Infection Resistant
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your immune system is particularly good at resisting infections.  You have "
"an increased chance for bad wounds and infections to heal on their own, and "
"only suffer reduced penalties from them."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema inmunológico es particularmente bueno para resistir infecciones. "
"Tienes mejor probabilidad de que las heridas graves y las infecciones se "
"curen solas, y solo sufres penalidades menores a causa de ellas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Infection Immune"
msgstr "Inmune a la Infección"

#. ~ Description for Infection Immune
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your bloodstream has developed antibiotic properties.  Your wounds will "
"never become infected."
msgstr ""
"Tu torrente sanguíneo ha desarrollado propiedades antibióticas. Tus heridas "
"nunca se infectarán."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycus Identity"
msgstr "Identidad de Mycus"

#. ~ Description for Mycus Identity
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We have synchronized our local physiology with that of the Mycus.  Any "
"spores we may encounter will not attempt to germinate inside the local "
"system, and we may traverse Mycus biospheres easily, as native bioforms "
"shift shape to accommodate us."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Parasite Immune"
msgstr "Inmune a los Parásitos"

#. ~ Description for Parasite Immune
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body is unusually inhospitable to parasitic lifeforms.  You will never "
"become infested with internal parasites."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo es extrañamente poco hospitalario a las formas de vida parásitas. "
"Nunca te infectarás con parásitos internos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Venomous"
msgstr "Venenoso"

#. ~ Description for Venomous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body produces a potent venom.  Cutting or stabbing attacks from "
"mutations have a chance to poison your target."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo produce un poderoso veneno. Los ataques cortantes o punzantes de "
"las mutaciones tienen una posibilidad de envenenar a tu oponente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Strongly Venomous"
msgstr "Poderosamente Venenoso"

#. ~ Description for Strongly Venomous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your venom has become particularly strong.  You're confident that your bites"
" or other cutting/stabbing natural attacks will take your target down "
"quickly."
msgstr ""
"Tu veneno se ha vuelto particularmente fuerte. Tienes confianza en que tus "
"mordeduras u otros ataques naturales cortantes o punzantes matarán a tu "
"oponente rápidamente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Slime Hands"
msgstr "Manos Babosas"

#. ~ Description for Slime Hands
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The skin on your hands is a mucous membrane and produces a thick, acrid "
"slime.  Attacks using your hand will cause minor acid damage.  Slightly "
"increases wet benefits."
msgstr ""
"La piel de tus manos es una membrana mucosa que produce una baba espesa y "
"acre. Los ataques usando tus manos causarán un daño menor de ácido. "
"Incrementa un poco los beneficios de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Stretchy Limbs"
msgstr "Miembros Elásticos"

#. ~ Description for Stretchy Limbs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your limbs seem to have a little more 'give' to them.  +1 Dexterity."
msgstr "Tus miembros parecen tener un poco más de elasticidad. Destreza +1."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Rubbery Limbs"
msgstr "Miembros de Goma"

#. ~ Description for Rubbery Limbs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your limbs are significantly more flexible than any pathetic human arm or "
"leg.  +3 Dexterity, -2 Strength."
msgstr ""
"Tus miembros son significativamente más flexibles que cualquier patético "
"brazo o pierna humanos. Destreza +3 y Fuerza -2."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pseudolimbs"
msgstr "Pseudomiembros"

#. ~ Description for Pseudolimbs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your pseudopod-like limbs can fit into anything!  +4 Dexterity, -4 Strength."
msgstr ""
"¡Tus miembros similares a los de un pseudópodo no se adaptan a nada! "
"Destreza +4 y Fuerza -4."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Compound Eyes"
msgstr "Ojos Compuestos"

#. ~ Description for Compound Eyes
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes are compound, like those of an insect.  This increases your "
"Perception by 2 so long as you aren't wearing eyewear."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Padded Feet"
msgstr "Pies Acolchados"

#. ~ Description for Padded Feet
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The bottoms of your feet are strongly padded.  You receive no movement "
"penalty for not wearing shoes, and even receive a 10% bonus when moving "
"barefoot."
msgstr ""
"Las plantas de tus pies están muy acolchadas. No recibes penalizaciones al "
"movimiento por no tener calzado, y recibes un bonus de 10% cuando andas "
"descalzo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Toe Talons"
msgstr "Zarpas en Pies"

#. ~ Description for Toe Talons
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have grown large, curved, and wickedly sharp talons in place of your big"
" toes.  Fortunately, they don't get in the way of your movement.  "
"Unfortunately, they do prevent wearing footgear."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You slash %s with a talon"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s slashes %2$s with a talon"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hooves"
msgstr "Pezuñas"

#. ~ Description for Hooves
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your feet have fused into hooves.  This allows kicking attacks to do much "
"more damage, provides natural armor, and removes the need to wear shoes; "
"however, you cannot wear shoes of any kind.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You kick %s with your hooves"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s kicks %2$s with their hooves"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Alcohol Metabolism"
msgstr "Metabolizar Alcohol"

#. ~ Description for Alcohol Metabolism
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"So it's fermented?  Whatever, it's still good drinking.  You've developed "
"the ability to metabolize alcohol as a food source."
msgstr ""
"¿Así que está fermentado? No importa, igual es una buena bebida. Has "
"desarrollado la capacidad de metabolizar el alcohol como si fuera comida."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Subterranean Fortitude"
msgstr "Fortaleza Subterránea"

#. ~ Description for Subterranean Fortitude
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "The aches and pains of living underground don't bother you as much."
msgstr "Los malestares y dolores de vivir bajo tierra, no te molestan tanto."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Subterranean Build"
msgstr "Constitución Subterránea"

#. ~ Description for Subterranean Build
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your frame has adapted for life in confined spaces.  You seem a little "
"shorter and bulkier, trading muscle mass for mobility.  (+2 Strength, -2 "
"Dexterity)"
msgstr ""
"Tu estructura se ha adaptado a la vida en espacios confinados. Pareces un "
"poco más petiso y corpulento, cambiaste movilidad por masa muscular. (Fuerza"
" +2 y Destreza -2)"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Saprovore"
msgstr "Saprófago"

#. ~ Description for Saprovore
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your digestive system is specialized to allow you to consume decaying "
"material.  You can eat rotten food, albeit for less nutrition than usual."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema digestivo se especializó en permitirte consumir materia en "
"descomposición. Puedes comer comida podrida, aunque obteniendo menos "
"nutrición que lo normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Saprophage"
msgstr "Saprófago"

#. ~ Description for Saprophage
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You prefer to sustain yourself using your roots and direct nutrient "
"extraction/synthesis.  You can still consume 'food', though, if you have to:"
" you merely prefer it aged a little."
msgstr ""
"Preferís alimentarte utilizando tus raíces y la extracción y síntesis "
"directa de nutrientes. Todavía puedes consumir 'comida', pero si tienes que "
"hacerlo, preferís que esté un poquito añeja."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Gizzard"
msgstr "Molleja"

#. ~ Description for Gizzard
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You seem to get full faster now, and food goes through you more rapidly as "
"well."
msgstr ""
"Has desarrollado mucha velocidad para comer, y la comida también pasa más "
"rápido por adentro tuyo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycus Feeder"
msgstr "Alimentador/a Mycus"

#. ~ Description for Mycus Feeder
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We have streamlined our nutritional requirements.  We rely on the Mycus for "
"sustenance, as it relies on us.  We may locate sources of sustenance within "
"the close proximity of Mycus core towers, and in forested areas that the "
"Mycus has grown into."
msgstr ""
"Hemos simplificado nuestros requisitos nutricionales. Dependemos del Mycus "
"para el sustento, como él depende de nosotros. Podemos encontrar recursos de"
" sustento en la proximidad de las torres centrales del Mycus, y en areas "
"forestales en donde el Mycus ha crecido."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Ruminant"
msgstr "Rumiante"

#. ~ Description for Ruminant
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your digestive system is capable of digesting cellulose and other rough "
"plant material.  You can eat underbrush and shrubs by activating this, "
"standing over your target, and pressing E."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Grazer"
msgstr "Pastador/a"

#. ~ Description for Grazer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're accustomed to eating plants directly, and can get nutrition from "
"grass as well as underbrush and shrubs.  Eat either one by activating this, "
"standing over your target, and pressing E."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Intestinal Fortitude"
msgstr "Fortaleza Intestinal"

#. ~ Description for Intestinal Fortitude
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your guts have developed the ability to handle poisonous food.  Mostly."
msgstr ""
"Tus tripas han desarrollado la capacidad de controlar la comida venenosa. La"
" mayoría, por lo menos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Eater Of The Dead"
msgstr "Comedor/a de Muertos"

#. ~ Description for Eater Of The Dead
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Eating rotting, long-dead flesh is good for the struggle, and safe--if still"
" completely unappealing--for you."
msgstr ""
"Comerse la carne podrida, muerta hace mucho tiempo es bueno para la lucha, y"
" también es seguro para ti aunque te siga pareciendo un asco."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Burrowing"
msgstr "Cavador/a"

#. ~ Description for Burrowing
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Between your claws and teeth, you can tunnel through just about anything."
msgstr ""
"Con tus garras y dientes puedes hacer un túnel a través de casi cualquier "
"cosa."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Saber Teeth"
msgstr "Dientes de Sable"

#. ~ Description for Saber Teeth
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your fangs have grown extremely large and incredibly sharp.  They make it "
"impossible to wear mouthgear and difficult to eat...  but leave nasty wounds"
" when you bite."
msgstr ""
"Tus colmillos han crecido extremadamente grandes e increíblemente afilados. "
"Te va a ser imposible usar equipo que cubre tu boca, y te resultará díficil "
"comer... pero dejas unas horribles heridas cuando muerdas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You tear into %s with your saber teeth"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their saber teeth"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hyper-Metabolism"
msgstr "Hiper-Metabolismo"

#. ~ Description for Hyper-Metabolism
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You metabolize nutrients so rapidly that you can convert food directly into "
"useful tissue.  Excess nutrition will convert to HP, rather than being "
"wasted.  Activate to skip prompt for overeating."
msgstr ""
"Metabolizás nutrientes tan rápido que podés convertir directamente la comida"
" en tejido útil. El exceso de nutrientes se convertirá en PV, en lugar de "
"desperdiciarse. Activalo para omitir el aviso por comer en exceso."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Horns"
msgstr "Cuernos"

#. ~ Description for Horns
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of small horns on your head.  They allow you to make a weak "
"piercing headbutt attack."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un par de pequeños cuernos en la cabeza. Te permiten causar un poco "
"de daño penetrante con tu cabezazo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You headbutt %s with your horns"
msgstr "Le das un cabezazo al %s con tus cuernos"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s headbutts %2$s with their horns"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Curled Horns"
msgstr "Cuernos Enroscados"

#. ~ Description for Curled Horns
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large curled horns, like those of a ram.  They allow you "
"to make a strong bashing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing any headwear."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You headbutt %s with your curled horns"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s headbutts %2$s with their curled horns"
msgstr "%1$s le da un cabezazo al %2$s con sus cuernos enroscados"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pointed Horns"
msgstr "Cuernos Puntiagudos"

#. ~ Description for Pointed Horns
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of long, pointed horns, like those of an antelope.  They "
"allow you to make a strong piercing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing "
"headwear that is not made of fabric."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You stab %s with your pointed horns"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s stabs %2$s with their pointed horns"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Antlers"
msgstr "Astas"

#. ~ Description for Antlers
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a huge rack of antlers, like those of a moose.  They allow you to "
"make a weak headbutt attack, but prevent wearing headwear that is not made "
"of fabric."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You butt %s with your antlers"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s butts %2$s with their antlers"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Antennae"
msgstr "Antenas"

#. ~ Description for Antennae
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of antennae.  They allow you to detect the presence of "
"monsters up to a few tiles away, even if you can't see or hear them, but "
"prevent wearing headwear that is not made of fabric."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Road-Runner"
msgstr "Correcaminos"

#. ~ Description for Road-Runner
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your legs are extremely limber and fast-moving.  You move 30% faster on flat"
" surfaces."
msgstr ""
"Tus piernas son extremadamente flexibles y rápidas. Te mueves un 30% más "
"rápido en superficies planas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Stubby Tail"
msgstr "Cola Regordeta"

#. ~ Description for Stubby Tail
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You have a short, stubby tail, like a rabbit's.  It serves no purpose."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una cola regordeta, corta, como la de un conejo. No te sirve para "
"nada."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tail Fin"
msgstr "Aleta Caudal"

#. ~ Description for Tail Fin
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a fin-like tail.  It allows you to swim more quickly, but prevents "
"wearing non-fabric pants.  Slightly increases wet benefits."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una cola que parece una aleta, como un pez. Te permite nadar más "
"rápido, pero no te permite utilizar pantalones que no sean de tela. "
"Incrementa levemente los beneficios de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Long Tail"
msgstr "Cola Larga"

#. ~ Description for Long Tail
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a long, graceful tail, like that of a big cat.  It improves your "
"balance, making your ability to dodge higher, but prevents wearing non-"
"fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una cola larga y elegante, como la de un felino grande. Mejora tu "
"balance, lo que incrementa tu habilidad de esquivar, pero no te permite "
"utilizar pantalones que no sean de tela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Cattle Tail"
msgstr "Cola de Ganado"

#. ~ Description for Cattle Tail
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a long tail with a tuft on the end.  You find yourself "
"instinctively swatting away flies with it, though it's not as effective at "
"balancing you as you'd like.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una cola larga con un penacho en la punta. Instintivamente, la usas "
"para sacarte las moscas de encima, pero no es tan buena para el balance como"
" te hubiera gustado. No te permite utilizar pantalones que no sean de tela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Rodent Tail"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Rodent Tail
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a long but hairless tail.  It's a pretty effective balancing aid, "
"but does look, uh, ratty.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una cola larga y pelada. Es una ayuda bastante efectiva para tu "
"balance, pero parece... eh... de rata. No te permite utilizar pantalones que"
" no sean de tela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Thick Tail"
msgstr "Cola Gruesa"

#. ~ Description for Thick Tail
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a long, thick, lizardlike tail.  It helps you balance a bit but "
"also makes a serviceable whip.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una cola larga y gruesa, como la de un lagarto. Ayuda un poco tu "
"balance pero también sirve como látigo. No te permite utilizar pantalones "
"que no sean de tela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You whap %s with your tail"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s whaps %2$s with their tail"
msgstr "%1$s le aporreas al %2$s con su cola"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Raptor Tail"
msgstr "Cola de Raptor"

#. ~ Description for Raptor Tail
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a long and semi-stiff lizardlike tail.  You can't effectively lash "
"it in combat, but it significantly improves your balance.  Prevents wearing "
"non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una cola larga y semi-rígida como la de un lagarto. No puedes usarla "
"efectivamente en combate, pero incrementa notablemente tu balance. No te "
"permite utilizar pantalones que no sean de tela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fluffy Tail"
msgstr "Cola Peludita"

#. ~ Description for Fluffy Tail
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a long, fluffy-furred tail.  It greatly improves your balance, "
"making your ability to dodge much higher.  Prevents wearing non-fabric "
"pants."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una cola larga y peludita. Mejora mucho tu balance, lo que incrementa"
" tu capacidad para esquivar. No te permite utilizar pantalones que no sean "
"de tela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Spiked Tail"
msgstr "Cola Aguijón"

#. ~ Description for Spiked Tail
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a long tail that ends in a vicious stinger, like that of a "
"scorpion.  It does not improve your balance at all, but allows for a "
"powerful piercing attack.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una cola larga que termina con un feroz aguijón, como la del "
"escorpión. No te mejora el balance para nada, pero te permite tener un "
"poderoso ataque penetrante. No te permite utilizar pantalones que no sean de"
" tela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You sting %s with your tail"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s stings %2$s with their tail"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Club Tail"
msgstr "Cola Garrote"

#. ~ Description for Club Tail
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a long tail that ends in a heavy, bony club.  It does not improve "
"your balance at all, but allows for a powerful bashing attack.  Prevents "
"wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una cola larga que termina en un garrote óseo pesado. No te mejora le"
" balance para nada, pero te permite tener un poderoso ataque golpeante. No "
"te permite utilizar pantalones que no sean de tela"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You club %s with your tail"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s clubs %2$s with their tail"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hibernation"
msgstr "Hibernación"

#. ~ Description for Hibernation
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've developed the ability to stockpile calories and then sleep for "
"extended periods of time."
msgstr ""
"Has desarrollado la habilidad de almacenar calorías y luego dormir por "
"períodos extensos de tiempo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Resilient"
msgstr "Resistente"

#. ~ Description for Resilient
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You can survive injuries that would incapacitate humans: you get a 20% bonus"
" to all hit points.  Stacks with Tough, etc."
msgstr ""
"Puedes sobrevivir a heridas que incapacitarían a otros humanos: tienes un "
"20% de bonus a tus puntos de vida. Es acumulativo con Duro, etc."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Solidly Built"
msgstr "Fornido/a"

#. ~ Description for Solidly Built
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Not much scares you.  You get a 30% bonus to all hit points.  Stacks with "
"Tough, etc."
msgstr ""
"No hay muchas cosas que te asusten. Tienes un 30% de bonus a tus puntos de "
"vida. Es acumulativo con Duro, etc."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "TAAANK"
msgstr "TAAANQUE"

#. ~ Description for TAAANK
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You can simply take the punishment from lesser beings and keep going.  You "
"get a 40% bonus to all hit points.  Stacks with Tough, etc."
msgstr ""
"Simplemente, puedes recibir el castigo de seres más pequeños y seguir como "
"si nada. Tienes un 40% de bonus a tus puntos de vida. Es acumulativo con "
"Duro, etc."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pain Recovery"
msgstr "Recuperación del Dolor"

#. ~ Description for Pain Recovery
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You recover from pain slightly faster than normal."
msgstr "Te recuperas del dolor un poco más rápido que lo normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Quick Pain Recovery"
msgstr "Recuperación Rápida del Dolor"

#. ~ Description for Quick Pain Recovery
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You recover from pain faster than normal."
msgstr "Te recuperas del dolor más rápido que lo normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Quick Pain Recovery"
msgstr "Recuperación Muy Rápida del Dolor"

#. ~ Description for Very Quick Pain Recovery
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You recover from pain much faster than normal."
msgstr "Te recuperas del dolor mucho más rápido que lo normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pain Junkie"
msgstr "Adicto/a al Dolor"

#. ~ Description for Pain Junkie
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've developed a serious appetite for pain, and take pride in your scars."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollaste un serio apetito por el dolor, y muestras con orgullo tus "
"cicatrices."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Cenobite"
msgstr "Cenobita"

#. ~ Description for Cenobite
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You positively adore pain, in all its varied forms."
msgstr "Ciertamente, adoras el dolor, en todas sus variedades posibles."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Deadened"
msgstr "Mitigado/a"

#. ~ Description for Deadened
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Nothing hurts any more.  Those bites tickle and the wounds itch a bit, but "
"that's it."
msgstr ""
"Ya nada te duele. Esas mordidas te hacen cosquillas y las heridas te pican "
"un poco, pero nada más."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pain Sensitive"
msgstr "Sensible al Dolor"

#. ~ Description for Pain Sensitive
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"For some reason things always seem to hurt you more.  Pain dealt to you is "
"increased by 25%."
msgstr ""
"Por alguna razón las cosas siempre parecen herirte más. El dolor que recibes"
" lo sientes un 25% mas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hyperalgesia"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Hyperalgesia
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your body experiences pain out of proportion to the physical causes.  Pain "
"dealt to you is increased by 50%."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Extreme Hyperalgesia"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Extreme Hyperalgesia
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body reacts cripplingly to any source of pain.  Pain dealt to you is "
"doubled."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Culler"
msgstr "Sacrificador/a"

#. ~ Description for Culler
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've had a revelation: by killing the weaker creatures, who would only die"
" anyway, you preserve resources for those better able to survive.  You are "
"less bothered by the deaths of others: their own weakness invited these "
"fates upon them."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py lang/json/npc_class_from_json.py
#: lang/json/npc_from_json.py
msgid "Hunter"
msgstr "Cazador/a"

#. ~ Description for Hunter
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your brain has a lot more in common with a predatory animal than a human, "
"making it easier to control misplaced reactions to the death of your prey.  "
"Additionally, combat skills, which you use to hunt, are easier to learn and "
"maintain."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Predator"
msgstr "Depredador/a"

#. ~ Description for Predator
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You consider yourself something other than human and no longer empathize "
"with them.  Combat skills are easy to learn and maintain, but your critical "
"thinking, so characteristic to these creatures, suffers."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Apex Predator"
msgstr "SuperDepredador/a"

#. ~ Description for Apex Predator
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your mind and brain have adapted to your new place in the world: as one on "
"top of the food chain.  You can effortlessly master and maintain combat "
"skills, but your critical thinking has atrophied further."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Sapiovore"
msgstr "Sapióvoro"

#. ~ Description for Sapiovore
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "The hairless apes make as good eating as any other meat."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycus Defender"
msgstr "Defensor/a Mycus"

#. ~ Description for Mycus Defender
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"From time to time the Mycus requires protection from non-Mycus that, for "
"whatever reason, wish it ill.  We have adapted to better carry out this task"
" - our fibers will grow strong and resilient when such threats present "
"themselves to us."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bird Wings"
msgstr "Alas de pájaro"

#. ~ Description for Bird Wings
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, feathered wings.  Your body is too heavy to be "
"able to fly, but you can use them to slow your descent during a fall, and "
"will not take falling damage under any circumstances."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un par de alas largas con plumas. Tu cuerpo es muy pesado para poder "
"volar, pero puedes usarlas para frenar una caída y no sufrir daño en ninguna"
" circunstancia."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Insect Wings"
msgstr "Alas de Insecto"

#. ~ Description for Insect Wings
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, translucent wings.  They are too small to lift "
"you, but are powerful enough to greatly speed your movement, with some "
"effort and noise."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un par de alas grandes y translúcidas. Son muy pequeñas para "
"levantarte, pero lo suficientemente fuertes para aumentar tu velocidad de "
"movimiento, con un poco de esfuerzo y ruido."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mouth Tentacles"
msgstr "Tentáculos Bucales"

#. ~ Description for Mouth Tentacles
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of tentacles surrounds your mouth.  They allow you to eat twice as "
"fast.  Slightly decreases wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"Un grupo de tentáculos te rodea la boca. Te permiten comer el doble de "
"rápido. Disminuye levemente las penalidades por estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mandibles"
msgstr "Mandíbulas"

#. ~ Description for Mandibles
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of insect-like mandibles have grown around your mouth.  They allow you"
" to eat faster and provide a slicing unarmed attack, but prevent wearing "
"mouthwear.  Slightly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You bite %s with your fangs"
msgstr "Mordiste a %s con tus colmillos"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s bites %2$s with their fangs"
msgstr "%1$s muerde a %2$s con sus colmillos"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Folding Fangs"
msgstr "Colmillos Plegables"

#. ~ Description for Folding Fangs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your mandibles have developed extensible fangs, allowing you to bite quickly"
" or ensure your venom goes home, as desired."
msgstr ""
"Tus mandíbulas han desarrollado colmillos extensibles, lo que te permite "
"morder rápido o asegurar que tu veneno llegue a destino, cuando quieras."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Canine Ears"
msgstr "Orejas Caninas"

#. ~ Description for Canine Ears
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your ears have extended into long, pointed ones, like those of a canine.  "
"They enhance your hearing, allowing you to hear at greater distances."
msgstr ""
"Tus orejas se extienden largas y puntiagudas, como las de los caninos. "
"Aumentan tu audición, lo que te permite escuchar a grandes distancias."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Lupine Ears"
msgstr "Orejas Lobunas"

#. ~ Description for Lupine Ears
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your hearing has evolved further and is now on par with wolves.  You can "
"hear things significantly farther away."
msgstr ""
"Tu audición ha evolucionado más y ya es del mismo nivel que la de los lobos."
" Puedes escuchar cosas que están considerablemente alejadas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Feline Ears"
msgstr "Orejas Felinas"

#. ~ Description for Feline Ears
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your ears have extended into long, pointed, velvety ones, like those of a "
"feline.  You find it easier to tune in on sounds from afar."
msgstr ""
"Tus orejas se extienden largas, puntiagudas y aterciopeladas, como las de "
"los felinos. Te resulta más fácil captar sonidos desde lejos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Ursine Ears"
msgstr "Orejas Osunas"

#. ~ Description for Ursine Ears
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your ears have grown longer and rounder, much like those of a bear.  You can"
" hear things a little farther away."
msgstr ""
"Tus orejas han crecido largas y redondas, muy parecidas a las de los osos. "
"Ahora escuchas cosas que están un poco más lejos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pointed Ears"
msgstr "Orejas Puntiagudas"

#. ~ Description for Pointed Ears
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your upper earlobes have grown noticeably higher.  Fortunately, they don't "
"get in the way of your headgear, much.  Unfortunately, they also don't seem "
"to help your hearing any."
msgstr ""
"Tus lóbulos superiores han crecido notablemente altos. Por suerte, no te "
"molestan para usar cosas en la cabeza, no mucho. Pero, no te mejoran la "
"audición."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Rodent Ears"
msgstr "Orejas de Roedor"

#. ~ Description for Rodent Ears
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your ears are huge, round, and gray!  They're rather fascinating, and help "
"you hear from a much greater distance."
msgstr ""
"¡Tus orejas son enormes, redondas y grises! Son fascinantes y te ayudan a "
"escuchar a mucha mayor distancia."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Web Walker"
msgstr "Caminador/a de Telarañas"

#. ~ Description for Web Walker
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body excretes very fine amounts of a chemical which prevents you from "
"sticking to webs.  Walking through webs does not affect you at all."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo segrega grandes cantidades de un químico que evita que te pegues "
"en las telarañas. Caminar a través de las telarañas no te afecta para nada."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Web Spinner"
msgstr "Hilandero/a de Telarañas"

#. ~ Description for Web Spinner
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body produces and anchors webbing.  Too bad you can't seem to control "
"the process.  There is a chance that you will leave webs in your wake."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo produce y coloca telarañas. Lo malo es que parece que no controlas"
" ese proceso. Hay una posibilidad de que dejes telarañas como estela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Web Weaver"
msgstr "Tejedor/a de Telarañas"

#. ~ Description for Web Weaver
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've developed the necessary anatomy and techniques to control your web-"
"generation.  Activate this to start or stop weaving webs."
msgstr ""
"Has desarrollado la anatomía necesaria y las técnicas para controlar tu "
"generación de telarañas. Hay que activar esta habilidad para empezar o dejar"
" de tejer telarañas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Web Diver"
msgstr "Saltador/a de Telarañas"

#. ~ Description for Web Diver
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your webbing is easily strong enough to support your weight.  You'll use it "
"to descend down any sheer drops you may encounter."
msgstr ""
"Tus telarañas son lo suficientemente fuertes como para soportar tu peso. Las"
" usarás para descender cualquier desnivel brusco que te encuentres."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Rope Webs"
msgstr "Cuerdas de Telaraña"

#. ~ Description for Rope Webs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With spinnerets like THESE, who needs rope?!  Activate to produce rope."
msgstr ""
"Con un hilador de telarañas como este, ¿Quién necesita cuerdas? Actívalo "
"para producir tu propia cuerda."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You spin a rope from your silk."
msgstr "Creas una cuerda con tu seda."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Whiskers"
msgstr "Bigotes"

#. ~ Description for Whiskers
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a handsome set of feline whiskers around your mouth.  These make "
"you more aware of vibrations in the air, and improve your ability to dodge "
"very slightly."
msgstr ""
"Tienes unos lindos bigotes felinos a los costados de tu boca. Te hacen más "
"consciente de las vibraciones del aire, y mejora muy levemente tu habilidad "
"para esquivar."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Wiry Whiskers"
msgstr "Bigotes Tiesos"

#. ~ Description for Wiry Whiskers
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a set of prominent rodent-like whiskers around your mouth.  These "
"make you more aware of vibrations in the air, and improve your ability to "
"dodge slightly."
msgstr ""
"Tienes unos bigotes prominentes como los de los roedores en los costados de "
"tu boca. Te hacen más consciente de las vibraciones del aire, y mejora "
"levemente tu habilidad para esquivar."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fat Deposits"
msgstr "Depósitos de Grasa"

#. ~ Description for Fat Deposits
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've put on some additional weight around your body.  It slows you down a "
"little, but helps your swimming and warmth."
msgstr ""
"Pusiste un poco más de peso alrededor de tu cuerpo. Te hace un poco más "
"lento, pero te ayuda a nadar y te abriga."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Inconveniently Large"
msgstr "Inconvenientemente Grande"

#. ~ Description for Inconveniently Large
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have grown noticeably taller and broader.  Much of it is useful muscle "
"mass (Strength +2), but you find it throws off your balance and you get in "
"your own way (+10 torso and arm encumbrance)."
msgstr ""
"Has crecido notablemente más alto y ancho. La mayoría es masa muscular útil "
"(Fuerza +2), pero notás que te quita el balance y estás más torpe (+10 de "
"incomodidad en torso y brazos)."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Large"
msgstr "Grande"

#. ~ Description for Large
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You carry your rugged body with the dignity you deserve.  Strength +2."
msgstr "Cargas tu robusto cuerpo con la dignidad que se merece. Fuerza +2."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Freakishly Huge"
msgstr "Peculiarmente Enorme"

#. ~ Description for Freakishly Huge
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have grown even more massive, to the point where you cannot usefully fit"
" into human-sized clothing or vehicles.  Much of it is powerful muscle mass "
"(Strength +4), but it's a real pain to haul around."
msgstr ""
"Has crecido todavía más, al punto que ya no entrás en la ropa tamaño humano "
"normal ni en los vehículos. La mayor parte de lo crecido es poderosa masa "
"muscular (Fuerza +4), pero es un verdadero problema ir acarreando tu cuerpo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Huge"
msgstr "Enorme"

#. ~ Description for Huge
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your cardiovascular system has caught up with your muscular physique, so who"
" needs pathetic human cars?  Strength +4."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema cardiovascular ha llegado al mismo nivel que tu físico, así que "
"¿Quién necesita esos patéticos coches de humanos? Fuerza +4."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Strong"
msgstr "Fuerte"

#. ~ Description for Strong
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your muscles are a little stronger.  Strength + 1"
msgstr "Tus músculos son un poco más fuertes. Fuerza +1."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Strong"
msgstr "Muy Fuerte"

#. ~ Description for Very Strong
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your muscles are stronger.  Strength + 2"
msgstr "Tus músculos son más fuertes. Fuerza +2."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Extremely Strong"
msgstr "Extremadamente Fuerte"

#. ~ Description for Extremely Strong
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your muscles are much stronger.  Strength + 4"
msgstr "Tus músculos son mucho más fuertes. Fuerza +4."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Insanely Strong"
msgstr "Terriblemente Fuerte"

#. ~ Description for Insanely Strong
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your muscles are noticeably bulging.  Strength + 7"
msgstr "Tus músculos son notablemente más fuertes. Fuerza +7."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Prime Strength"
msgstr "Fuerza Suprema"

#. ~ Description for Prime Strength
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your muscles are perfectly developed."
msgstr "Tus músculos están perfectamente desarrollados."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Dextrous"
msgstr "Diestro/a"

#. ~ Description for Dextrous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You are a little nimbler.  Dexterity + 1"
msgstr "Eres un poco más ágil. Destreza +1."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Dextrous"
msgstr "Muy Diestro/a"

#. ~ Description for Very Dextrous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You are nimbler.  Dexterity + 2"
msgstr "Eres más ágil. Destreza +2."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Extremely Dextrous"
msgstr "Extremadamente Diestro/a"

#. ~ Description for Extremely Dextrous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You are nimble and quick.  Dexterity + 4"
msgstr "Eres más ágil y rápido. Destreza +4."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Insanely Dextrous"
msgstr "Terriblemente Diestro/a"

#. ~ Description for Insanely Dextrous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You are much nimbler than before.  Dexterity + 7"
msgstr "Eres mucho más ágil que antes. Destreza +7."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Prime Dexterity"
msgstr "Destreza Suprema"

#. ~ Description for Prime Dexterity
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You're perfectly coordinated."
msgstr "Tienes una coordinación perfecta."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "Inteligente"

#. ~ Description for Smart
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You are a little smarter.  Intelligence + 1"
msgstr "Eres un poco más inteligente. Inteligencia +1."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Smart"
msgstr "Muy Inteligente"

#. ~ Description for Very Smart
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You are smarter.  Intelligence + 2"
msgstr "Eres más inteligente. Inteligencia +2."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Extremely Smart"
msgstr "Extremadamente Ingeligente"

#. ~ Description for Extremely Smart
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are much smarter, and your skull bulges slightly.  Intelligence + 4"
msgstr ""
"Eres mucho más inteligente, y tu cráneo aumentó un poco de tamaño. "
"Inteligencia +4."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Insanely Smart"
msgstr "Terriblemente Inteligente"

#. ~ Description for Insanely Smart
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skull bulges noticeably due to your impressive brain.  Intelligence + 7"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Prime Intelligence"
msgstr "Inteligencia Suprema"

#. ~ Description for Prime Intelligence
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You understand almost everything about which you think, with minimal effort."
msgstr "Entiendes casi todo lo que puedes pensar, con un esfuerzo mínimo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Distributed Neurology"
msgstr "Neurología Distribuida"

#. ~ Description for Distributed Neurology
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your brain has evolved beyond human imagination.  You'll show them the REAL "
"meaning of 'gray goo'!"
msgstr ""
"Tu cerebro ha evolucionado más allá de las posibilidades humanas. ¡Ahora les"
" vas a mostrar el VERDADERO sentido de 'materia gris'!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Perceptive"
msgstr "Perceptivo/a"

#. ~ Description for Perceptive
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your senses are a little keener.  Perception + 1"
msgstr "Tus sentidos son un poco más agudos. Percepción +1."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Perceptive"
msgstr "Muy Perceptivo/a"

#. ~ Description for Very Perceptive
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your senses are keener.  Perception + 2"
msgstr "Tus sentidos son más agudos. Percepción +2."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Extremely Perceptive"
msgstr "Extremadamente Perceptivo/a"

#. ~ Description for Extremely Perceptive
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your senses are much keener.  Perception + 4"
msgstr "Tus sentidos son mucho más agudos. Percepción +4."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Insanely Perceptive"
msgstr "Terriblemente Perceptivo/a"

#. ~ Description for Insanely Perceptive
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You can sense things you never imagined.  Perception + 7"
msgstr "Puedes percibir cosas que nunca te imaginaste. Percepción +7."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Prime Perception"
msgstr "Percepción Suprema"

#. ~ Description for Prime Perception
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your senses are keenly honed."
msgstr "Tus sentidos están perfectamente agudizados."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Sensory Disintegration"
msgstr "Desintegración Sensorial"

#. ~ Description for Sensory Disintegration
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your sense organs are all over the place: eyes extending and retracting, "
"'ears' of various shapes migrating about, and taste & smell are "
"uncontrollable.  The world is a horrible mixup.  Ugh!"
msgstr ""
"Tus órganos sensoriales están por todos lados: ojos que se extienden y "
"retraen, 'orejas' de diversas formas, y el gusto y el olfato son "
"incontrolables. El mundo es una terrible confusión. ¡Puf!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Distributed Senses"
msgstr "Sentidos Distribuidos"

#. ~ Description for Distributed Senses
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can now extend and reabsorb sensory organs at will, and can therefore "
"ignore most shocks that would overwhelm lesser beings."
msgstr ""
"Ahora puedes extender y reabsorber a voluntad tus órganos sensoriales, y por"
" lo tanto ignorás las conmociones que abrumarían a seres inferiores."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Little"
msgstr "Pequeño"

#. ~ Description for Little
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've noticeably shrunk in size.  You're able to move with increased "
"litheness, but your smaller stature prevents you from carrying as much."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tiny"
msgstr "Diminuto"

#. ~ Description for Tiny
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're only half as tall as you used to be!  The weight of things you once "
"found easy to carry is now unbearable, clothes are now twice as encumbering "
"for you unless you refit them (since you're half their size), and your hit "
"points are heavily reduced.  However, your movement is silent, and your "
"dodge skill is a little higher."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Unassuming"
msgstr "Insignificante"

#. ~ Description for Unassuming
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've mastered your tiny form!  Item encumbrance and carry weight penalties"
" are reduced, and you've learned to use your increased nimbleness to offset "
"your reduced capacity to absorb damage."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Crafty"
msgstr "Astuto"

#. ~ Description for Crafty
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"By making the most of your small stature, you can avoid the notice of all "
"but the most perceptive creatures, and your speed is greatly increased."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Metallassomaiphile"
msgstr "Metallassomáfilo/a"

#. ~ Description for Metallassomaiphile
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Just thinking of mutagen (such a lovely word!  'Mutagen'.  Perfect!) makes "
"you thirsty.  And you so love your new parts.  You simply must have more "
"mutagen!"
msgstr ""
"Con solo pensar en mutágeno (¡qué linda palabra! 'Mutágeno'. ¡Perfecta!) te "
"agarra sed. Y te fascinan tus partes nuevas. ¡Necesitas conseguir más "
"mutágeno!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Head Bumps"
msgstr "Protuberancias en la Cabeza"

#. ~ Description for Head Bumps
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You have a pair of bumps on your skull."
msgstr "Tienes un par de protuberancias en el cráneo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Slit Nostrils"
msgstr "Tajos Nasales"

#. ~ Description for Slit Nostrils
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a flattened nose and thin slits for nostrils, giving you a lizard-"
"like appearance.  This makes breathing slightly difficult and increases "
"mouth encumbrance by 10."
msgstr ""
"Tienes la nariz aplanada y tus fosas nasales son unos tajos delgados, lo que"
" te da una apariencia de lagarto. Esto te dificulta levemente la respiración"
" e incrementa la incomodidad en tu boca en 10 puntos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Forked Tongue"
msgstr "Lengua Bífida"

#. ~ Description for Forked Tongue
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your tongue is forked, like that of a reptile.  This has no effect."
msgstr ""
"Tu lengua está bifurcada, como la de un reptil. Esto no tiene ningún efecto."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bulging Eyes"
msgstr "Ojos Saltones"

#. ~ Description for Bulging Eyes
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your eyes bulge out several inches from your skull.  This does not affect "
"your vision in any way."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos sobresalen algunos centímetros de tu cráneo. Esto no afecta tu "
"visión de ninguna manera."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mouth Flaps"
msgstr "Aletas Bucales"

#. ~ Description for Mouth Flaps
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Skin tabs and odd flaps of skin surround your mouth.  They don't affect your"
" eating, but are unpleasant to look at."
msgstr ""
"Unas extrañas aletas y lengüetas de piel rodean tu boca. No te molestan para"
" comer, pero son desagradables de ver."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Wing Stubs"
msgstr "Alas Muñones"

#. ~ Description for Wing Stubs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of stubby little wings projecting from your shoulderblades."
"  They can be wiggled at will, but are useless."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un par de pequeñas alas regordetas que salen de tus omóplatos. Las "
"puedes mover a voluntad, pero no sirven para nada."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bat Wings"
msgstr "Alas de Murciélago"

#. ~ Description for Bat Wings
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, leathery wings.  You can move them a little, but "
"they are useless, and in fact put you off balance, reducing your ability to "
"dodge slightly."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un par de alas grandes de cuero. Las puedes mover un poquito, pero no"
" sirven para nada, y de hecho te sacan de balance reduciendo levemente tu "
"habilidad para esquivar."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Butterfly Wings"
msgstr "Alas de Mariposa"

#. ~ Description for Butterfly Wings
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a very large and very beautiful pair of brightly-colored wings.  "
"They can't lift you, and they make balancing tricky, but they certainly "
"catch air and attention!"
msgstr ""
"Tenes un par de alas muy grandes y hermosas de colores brillantes. No te "
"pueden levantar, y te complican un poco el balance, ¡pero ciertamente "
"capturan la atención!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pale Skin"
msgstr "Piel Pálida"

#. ~ Description for Pale Skin
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your skin is rather pale."
msgstr "Tu piel es más bien pálida."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Spots"
msgstr "Manchas"

#. ~ Description for Spots
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your skin is covered in a pattern of red spots."
msgstr "Tu piel está cubierta con un diseño de manchas rojas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Smelly"
msgstr "Oloroso"

#. ~ Description for Smelly
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You smell awful.  Monsters that track scent will find you very easily, and "
"humans will react poorly."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una baranda horrible. Los monstruos que te rastrean por tu olor te "
"van a encontrar fácilmente, y los humanos no te van a querer cerca."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Deformed"
msgstr "Deforme"

#. ~ Description for Deformed
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're slightly deformed.  Some people will react badly to your appearance."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Badly Deformed"
msgstr "Muy Deforme"

#. ~ Description for Badly Deformed
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're hideously deformed.  Some people will have a strong negative reaction"
" to your appearance."
msgstr ""
"Estás horriblemente deformado. Alguna gente va a reaccionar muy "
"negativamente a tu apariencia."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Grotesque"
msgstr "Grotesco/a"

#. ~ Description for Grotesque
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your visage is disgusting and liable to induce vomiting.  People will not "
"want to interact with you unless they have a very good reason to."
msgstr ""
"Tu cara es repugnante y es probable que induzca al vómito. La gente no va a "
"querer interactuar contigo salvo que tengan una muy buena razón para "
"hacerlo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Beautiful"
msgstr "Hermoso/a"

#. ~ Description for Beautiful
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're a real head-turner.  Some people will react well to your appearance, "
"and most people have an easier time trusting you."
msgstr ""
"Eres de esos que hacen girar la cabeza a los demás. Algunos van a reaccionar"
" bien a tu apariencia, y a la mayoría les resultará más fácil confiar en ti."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Beautiful"
msgstr "Muy Hermoso/a"

#. ~ Description for Very Beautiful
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are a vision of beauty.  Some people will react very well to your looks,"
" and most people will trust you immediately."
msgstr ""
"Posees una vista hermosa. Algunos van a reaccionar muy bien a tu apariencia,"
" y la mayoría van a confiar en ti inmediatamente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Glorious"
msgstr "Espléndido/a"

#. ~ Description for Glorious
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are incredibly beautiful.  People cannot help themselves due to your "
"charms, and will do whatever they can to please you."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Snout"
msgstr "Hocico"

#. ~ Description for Snout
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your face and jaw have begun...changing.  Masks and such fit OK, but you're "
"noticeably mutated."
msgstr ""
"Tu cara y mandíbula han empezado a... cambiar. Las máscaras te quedan bien, "
"pero se te nota la mutación."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bovine Snout"
msgstr "Hocico Bovino"

#. ~ Description for Bovine Snout
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your face resembles that of a bull, with a significant snout.  It looks "
"fearsome but prevents wearing mouthgear."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Lupine Muzzle"
msgstr "Hocico Lobuno"

#. ~ Description for Lupine Muzzle
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your jaw and nose have extended into a wolfish muzzle.  It lends itself to "
"biting in combat and looks impressive, but prevents wearing mouthgear."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You nip at %s"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s nips and harries %2$s"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Ursine Muzzle"
msgstr "Hocico Osuno"

#. ~ Description for Ursine Muzzle
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your jaw and nose have extended into a bearish muzzle.  You could bite with "
"it, and it looks impressive, but it prevents wearing mouthgear."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You bite %s"
msgstr "Muerdes %s"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s bites %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s muerde %2$s"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Rodent Muzzle"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Rodent Muzzle
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your face and jaw have extended, giving you an alert and attentive "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"Tu cara y mandíbula se han extendido, lo que te da una apariencia alerta y "
"atenta."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Reptilian Muzzle"
msgstr "Hocico Reptiliano"

#. ~ Description for Reptilian Muzzle
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your face and jaws are a shorter version of those found on alligators.  They"
" look NASTY--as do the bite wounds they can inflict--but prevent wearing "
"mouthgear."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You bite a chunk out of %s"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s bites a chunk out of %2$s"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Proboscis"
msgstr "Probóscide"

#. ~ Description for Proboscis
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've gotten rid of that terribly imprecise mouth and now imbibe your food "
"like a proper person.  Chewing was tiresome anyway."
msgstr ""
"Te liberaste de esa boca terriblemente imprecisa y ahora absorbes tu comida "
"por tu trompa como una persona correcta. De todas formas, masticar era "
"agotador."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hollow Bones"
msgstr "Huesos Huecos"

#. ~ Description for Hollow Bones
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You have Avian Bone Syndrome--your bones are nearly hollow.  Your body is "
"very light as a result, enabling you to move and attack 20% faster, but also"
" frail; you can carry 40% less, and bashing attacks injure you more."
msgstr ""
"Tienes el Síndrome de los Huesos Aviarios -tus huesos son casi huecos. Como "
"resultado tu cuerpo es muy liviano, lo que te permite moverte y atacar un "
"20% más rápido, pero también es frágil. Puedes cargar un 40% menos, y los "
"ataques golpeantes te causan más daño."

#. ~ Description for Nausea
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You feel nauseous almost constantly, and are more liable to throw up from "
"food poisoning, alcohol, etc.  You can, if desired, think yourself into "
"vomiting, too."
msgstr ""
"Sientes náuseas casi constantemente, y eres más propenso a vomitar por "
"intoxicación con la comida, el alcohol, etc. Puedes, si quieres, hacerte "
"vomitar con solo pensarlo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Vomitous"
msgstr "Vómitos"

#. ~ Description for Vomitous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a major digestive disorder.  Though it causes you to vomit "
"frequently, you have found that you can trigger your vomit reflex on demand,"
" too."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un desorden alimenticio grave. Aunque te causa vomitar con "
"frecuencia, descubriste que puedes hacerte vomitar cuando quieras."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fast Metabolism"
msgstr "Metabolismo Veloz"

#. ~ Description for Fast Metabolism
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You require more food than most people, but recover stamina slightly faster."
msgstr ""
"Necesitás más comida que la mayoría de la gente, pero recuperás tu "
"resistencia bastante más rápido."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Rapid Metabolism"
msgstr "Metabolismo Rápido"

#. ~ Description for Rapid Metabolism
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You require more resources than most, but heal more rapidly as well.  "
"Provides weak regeneration even when not asleep."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Fast Metabolism"
msgstr "Metabolismo Muy Rápido"

#. ~ Description for Very Fast Metabolism
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You need about twice as much food as the average human to maintain your "
"expanded cardiovascular and respiratory systems.  On a plus side, it doesn't"
" take you much time to recover from any strenuous activity."
msgstr ""
"Necesitás más o menos el doble de comida que un humano promedio para "
"mantener tus sistemas respiratorio y cardiovascular. La ventaja es que no "
"tardás mucho tiempo en recuperarte de cualquier actividad extenuante."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Extreme Metabolism"
msgstr "Metabolismo Extremo"

#. ~ Description for Extreme Metabolism
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You consume three times as much food as the average human to maintain your "
"truly superhuman endurance."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "High Thirst"
msgstr "Alta Sed"

#. ~ Description for High Thirst
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your body dries out easily; you need to drink more water."
msgstr "Tu cuerpo se seca con facilidad; necesitas beber más agua."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Thirsty"
msgstr "Mucha Sed"

#. ~ Description for Very Thirsty
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ugh, out of water already?  You need about twice the fluids of an average "
"human."
msgstr ""
"Puf, ¿otra vez sin agua? Necesitas más o menos el doble de fluidos que una "
"persona normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Extremely Thirsty"
msgstr "Sed Extrema"

#. ~ Description for Extremely Thirsty
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You dry out seriously quickly, requiring three times as much liquid to stay "
"hydrated."
msgstr ""
"Te secas verdaderamente rápido, por lo que necesitas tres veces más de "
"líquido para mantenerte hidratado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Metabolic Rehydration"
msgstr "Rehidratación Metabólica"

#. ~ Description for Metabolic Rehydration
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body gets everything it needs from the food that you eat!  You no "
"longer gain hydration from fluids - instead, your thirst will be equal to, "
"and change with, your hunger."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Heavy Sleeper"
msgstr "Sueño Muy Pesado"

#. ~ Description for Very Heavy Sleeper
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You could probably sleep through a firefight."
msgstr "Probablemente, podrías dormir durante un tiroteo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Sleepy"
msgstr "Mucho Sueño"

#. ~ Description for Very Sleepy
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You find yourself needing to sleep quite often.  You'll spend about half of "
"your time in or around bed."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Weakening"
msgstr "Debilitándote"

#. ~ Description for Weakening
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You feel as though you are slowly weakening and your body heals slower."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Deterioration"
msgstr "Deterioración"

#. ~ Description for Deterioration
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your body is very slowly wasting away."
msgstr "Muy lentamente, tu cuerpo se va quedando en piel y hueso."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Disintegration"
msgstr "Desintegración"

#. ~ Description for Disintegration
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your body is slowly wasting away!"
msgstr "¡Lentamente, tu cuerpo se va quedando en piel y hueso!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Solar Sensitivity"
msgstr "Sensibilidad Solar"

#. ~ Description for Solar Sensitivity
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skin simply cannot handle ultraviolet radiation, such as sunlight.  It "
"will seriously burn you."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel no puede soportar la radiación ultravioleta, como la luz del solar. "
"Te va a quemar seriamente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Sores"
msgstr "Llagas"

#. ~ Description for Sores
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your extremities are covered in painful sores.  The pain is worse when they "
"are covered in clothing."
msgstr ""
"Tus extremidades están cubiertas de dolorosas llagas. El dolor es peor "
"cuando tienes puesta alguna ropa."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Light Sensitive"
msgstr "Sensible a la Luz"

#. ~ Description for Light Sensitive
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sunlight makes you uncomfortable.  If you are outdoors and the weather is "
"Sunny, you suffer -1 to all stats."
msgstr ""
"La luz del sol te molesta. Si estás afuera y el clima está soleado, sufres "
"una penalización de -1 en todas tus características."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Light Sensitive"
msgstr "Muy Sensible a la Luz"

#. ~ Description for Very Light Sensitive
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sunlight makes you very uncomfortable.  If you are outdoors during the day, "
"you suffer -1 to all stats; -2 if the weather is Sunny."
msgstr ""
"La luz del sol te molesta mucho. Si estás afuera durante el día, sufres una "
"penalización de -1 en todas tus características, y -2 si el clima está "
"soleado."

#. ~ Description for Troglobite
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sunlight makes you extremely uncomfortable, resulting in large penalties to "
"all stats."
msgstr ""
"La luz del sol te molesta extremadamente, lo que resulta en penalidades "
"grandes para tus características."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Webbed Hands"
msgstr "Manos Palmeadas"

#. ~ Description for Webbed Hands
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your hands and feet are heavily webbed, reducing your Dexterity by 1 and "
"causing problems with gloves.  However, you can swim much faster.  Slightly "
"decreases wet penalties."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Paws"
msgstr "Patas"

#. ~ Description for Paws
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your hands have fused into quasi-paws.  Fine manipulation is a challenge: "
"permanent hand encumbrance of 10, difficulty with delicate craftwork, and "
"your gloves don't fit.  But they handle water better."
msgstr ""
"Tus manos se han fusionado en cuasi-patas. Se te complica la motricidad "
"fina: tienes una incomodidad de 10 permanente en las manos, es difícil la "
"fabricación de cosas delicadas, y no entran los guantes. Pero se manejan "
"mejor en el agua."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Broad Paws"
msgstr "Patas Anchas"

#. ~ Description for Broad Paws
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your paws are much larger now.  Manual dexterity is difficult: permanent "
"hand encumbrance of 20, serious problems crafting, and no gloves.  But you "
"can swim more effectively."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Beak"
msgstr "Pico"

#. ~ Description for Beak
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a beak for a mouth.  You can occasionally use it to peck at your "
"enemies, but it is impossible for you to wear mouth gear.  Slightly reduces "
"wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un pico en lugar de la boca. Ocasionalmente, lo puedes usar para "
"picar a tus enemigos, pero es imposibles usar algo sobre tu cara. Disminuye "
"levemente los efectos de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You peck %s"
msgstr "Picoteas %s"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s pecks %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s picotea %2$s"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Woodpecker Beak"
msgstr "Pico de Pájaro Carpintero"

#. ~ Description for Woodpecker Beak
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Pecking at prey is part of your daily routine now.  Slightly reduces wet "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Picar a tus presas se ha convertido en parte de tu rutina diaria. Disminuye "
"levemente los efectos de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You jackhammer into %s with your beak"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s jackhammer into %2$s with their beak"
msgstr "%1$s taladra al %2$s con su pico"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hummingbird Beak"
msgstr "Pico de Picaflor"

#. ~ Description for Hummingbird Beak
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Though your beak's not suitable for pecking, those flowers out there are a "
"good source of energy.  Examine them to feed."
msgstr ""
"Aunque tu pico no es apropiado para picar, esas flores que andan por ahí son"
" una buena fuente de energía. Examinalas para alimentarte."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Genetically Unstable"
msgstr "Genéticamente Inestable"

#. ~ Description for Genetically Unstable
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your DNA has been damaged in a way that causes you to continually develop "
"more mutations."
msgstr ""
"Tu ADN ha sido dañado de una manera que te causa desarrollar mutaciones "
"continuamente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Genetic Chaos"
msgstr "Caos Genético"

#. ~ Description for Genetic Chaos
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body alters itself rapidly, and without your intervention or conscious "
"control."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo se altera muy rápidamente, y sin que tú tengas ningún control "
"sobre eso."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Minor Radioactivity"
msgstr "Radiactividad Menor"

#. ~ Description for Minor Radioactivity
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit low levels of "
"radiation, which slowly contaminates the world around you."
msgstr ""
"¡Tu cuerpo se ha vuelto radiactivo! Estás continuamente emitiendo niveles "
"bajos de radiación, que contamina lentamente el mundo que te rodea."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Radioactivity"
msgstr "Radiactividad"

#. ~ Description for Radioactivity
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit moderate levels of "
"radiation, which contaminates the world around you."
msgstr ""
"¡Tu cuerpo se ha vuelto radiactivo! Estás continuamente emitiendo niveles "
"medios de radiación, que contamina el mundo que te rodea."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Severe Radioactivity"
msgstr "Radiactividad Severa"

#. ~ Description for Severe Radioactivity
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit heavy levels of "
"radiation, making your surroundings unlivable."
msgstr ""
"¡Tu cuerpo se ha vuelto radiactivo! Estás continuamente emitiendo grandes "
"niveles de radiación, lo que vuelve inhabitables tus alrededores."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Slimy"
msgstr "Baboso/a"

#. ~ Description for Slimy
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body is coated with a fine slime.  Protects from long term effects of "
"acid, though not short term ones.  Greatly increases wet benefits."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo está cubierto con una baba fina. Te protege de los efectos de "
"largo plazo del ácido, pero no de los efectos de corto plazo. Incrementa "
"mucho los beneficios de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Viscous"
msgstr "Viscoso/a"

#. ~ Description for Viscous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body's slime output has become sticky and gel-like.  Protects from acid"
" somewhat.  Greatly increases wet benefits."
msgstr ""
"La baba que emite tu cuerpo se ha vuelto más pegajosa y con consistencia de "
"gel. Te protege un poco del ácido e incrementa mucho los beneficios de estar"
" mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Amorphous Body"
msgstr "Cuerpo Amorfo"

#. ~ Description for Amorphous Body
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your flesh is a pleasing gel-like consistency.  Your bodily functions seem "
"to be moving around, and your leg-equivalents flow comfortably."
msgstr ""
"Tu carne tiene un agradable consistencia similar al gel. Tus funciones "
"corporales parecen estar desplazándose, y lo que serían tus piernas fluyen "
"cómodamente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Omnicellular"
msgstr "Omnicelular"

#. ~ Description for Omnicellular
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body is more or less one consistent whole: a single, giant, omni-cell "
"that alters itself as needed."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo es más o menos un todo consistente: una omnicélula sola, gigante, "
"que se altera a sí misma según sea necesario."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Herbivore"
msgstr "Herbívoro/a"

#. ~ Description for Herbivore
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body's ability to digest meat is severely hampered.  Eating meat has a "
"good chance of making you vomit it back up; even if you manage to keep it "
"down, its nutritional value is greatly reduced."
msgstr ""
"La capacidad de tu cuerpo para digerir carne está muy limitada. Hay mucha "
"probabilidad de que comer carne te haga vomitar, e incluso cuando la puedes "
"mantener adentro, su valor nutricional se reduce mucho."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Carnivore"
msgstr "Carnívoro/a"

#. ~ Description for Carnivore
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body's ability to digest fruits, vegetables and grains is severely "
"hampered.  You cannot eat anything besides meat."
msgstr ""
"La capacidad de tu cuerpo para digerir frutas, verduras y granos está muy "
"limitada. No puedes comer nada que no sea carne."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Ponderous"
msgstr "Pesado/a"

#. ~ Description for Ponderous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "Your muscles are generally slow to move.  You move 10% slower."
msgstr ""
"Tus músculos son generalmente lentos en sus movimientos. Te mueves un 10% "
"más lento."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Ponderous"
msgstr "Muy Pesado/a"

#. ~ Description for Very Ponderous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "Your muscles are quite slow to move.  You move 20% slower."
msgstr ""
"Tus músculos son bastante lentos en sus movimientos. Te mueves un 20% más "
"lento."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Extremely Ponderous"
msgstr "Extremadamente Pesado/a"

#. ~ Description for Extremely Ponderous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "Your muscles are very slow to move.  You move 30% slower."
msgstr ""
"Tus músculos son muy lentos en sus movimientos. Te mueves un 30% más lento."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Sunlight Dependent"
msgstr "Dependiente del Sol"

#. ~ Description for Sunlight Dependent
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You feel very sluggish when not in direct sunlight.  You suffer a 5% drop in"
" speed when in shade, and a 10% drop in speed when in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes con muy poco vigor cuando no estás expuesto a la luz del sol. "
"Sufres una caída del 5% en tu velocidad cuando estás en la sombra, y un 10% "
"cuando está oscuro."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Vines"
msgstr "Enredaderas"

#. ~ Description for Vines
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have developed several vines sprouting from your shoulder area.  They're"
" bulky and get in the way."
msgstr ""
"Has desarrollado enredaderas que brotan desde tus hombros. Son grandes y te "
"molestan."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Vine Limbs"
msgstr "Miembros Enredaderas"

#. ~ Description for Vine Limbs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've developed the ability to control your vines; they make good lashes.  "
"You can even rappel down sheer drops using them, but disconnecting HURTS."
msgstr ""
"Has desarrollado la capacidad de control tus enredaderas; sirven como "
"látigos. Incluso las puedes usar para descender por superficies verticales, "
"pero soltarlas DUELE."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You lash %s with a vine"
msgstr "Le pegás un latigazo al %s con una liana"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s lashes %2$s with their vines"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Vine Sprouter"
msgstr "Germinador/a de Enredaderas"

#. ~ Description for Vine Sprouter
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have full control of your vines, and can grow new ones and detach old "
"ones more or less at will."
msgstr ""
"Tienes control total sobre tus enredaderas, y puedes hacer crecer nuevas y "
"soltar las viejas, casi a voluntad."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You detach a vine from your body."
msgstr "Te sacás una liana de tu cuerpo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Toe Roots"
msgstr "Dedos Raíces"

#. ~ Description for Toe Roots
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your toes have grown wriggly, and you can't imagine why you wear that stuff "
"on your feet.  Take it off.  It's in the way."
msgstr ""
"Tus dedos de los pies han crecido retorcidos, y no te puedes ni imaginar por"
" qué tienes calzado en los pies. Saquítelo, te molesta."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Roots"
msgstr "Raíces"

#. ~ Description for Roots
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's about time you started developing a root system.  When reading, "
"fishing, waiting, or otherwise being stationary for a while on diggable "
"terrain, you'll extract nutrients and water from the soil."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Rooter"
msgstr "Arraigador/a"

#. ~ Description for Rooter
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You find it difficult not to sink roots when able.  You extract nutrients "
"and water whenever on diggable terrain, but move more slowly."
msgstr ""
"Te cuesta no clavar tu raíces cada vez que puedes. Vas a extraer los "
"nutrientes y agua cuando estés sobre terreno cavable, pero te vas a mover "
"más lento."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Chloromorphosis"
msgstr "Cloromorfosis"

#. ~ Description for Chloromorphosis
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Every inch of your skin is packed with chlorophyll and you have strong "
"roots.  Sleeping on diggable soil will satisfy any hunger or thirst you "
"might have."
msgstr ""
"Cada centímetro de tu piel está lleno con clorofila y tienes raíces fuertes."
" Si duermes en suelo cavable vas a satisfacer el hambre o sed que tengas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Heat Dependent"
msgstr "Dependiente del Calor"

#. ~ Description for Heat Dependent
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose 1% of "
"your speed for every 5 (2.8) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C).  This sluggishness"
" helps you conserve energy, however."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Heat Dependent"
msgstr "Muy Dependiente del Calor"

#. ~ Description for Very Heat Dependent
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is highly dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose "
"1% of your speed for every 3 (1.7) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C), but your "
"slow metabolism requires much less food."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Cold Blooded"
msgstr "Sangre Fría"

#. ~ Description for Cold Blooded
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are cold-blooded and rely on heat to keep moving.  Your lose 1% of your "
"speed for every 2 (1.1) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C), but only need to eat "
"about half as much as before."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Ectothermic"
msgstr "Ectotérmico/a"

#. ~ Description for Ectothermic
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body has become permanently cold-blooded.  Your speed lowers--or raises"
"--for every 2 (1.1) degrees below or above 65 F (18.3 C).  You only need to "
"eat half as much as an average human."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Growling Voice"
msgstr "Gruñido"

#. ~ Description for Growling Voice
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a growling, rough voice.  Persuading NPCs will be more difficult, "
"but threatening them will be easier."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una voz áspera, como un gruñido. Te va a resultar más difícil "
"persuadir a los PNJ, pero amenazarlos va a ser más fácil."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Snarling Voice"
msgstr "Rugidor/a"

#. ~ Description for Snarling Voice
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a threatening snarl in your voice.  Persuading NPCs will be near "
"impossible, but threatening them will be much easier."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un rugido amenazante en tu voz. Te va a resultar casi imposible "
"persuadir a los PNJ, pero amenazarlos va a ser mucho más fácil."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hissing Voice"
msgstr "Siseador/a"

#. ~ Description for Hissing Voice
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You hiss when speaking.  Persuading NPCs will be more difficult, but "
"threatening them will be easier."
msgstr ""
"Siseás cuando hablás. Te va a resultar más difícil persuadir a los PNJ, pero"
" amenazarlos va a ser más fácil."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Shouter"
msgstr "Gritador/a"

#. ~ Description for Shouter
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You occasionally shout uncontrollably."
msgstr "Ocasionalmente, se te escapa un grito."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Screamer"
msgstr "Alarido"

#. ~ Description for Screamer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You sometimes scream uncontrollably."
msgstr "Ocasionalmente, se te escapa un alarido."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Howler"
msgstr "Aullador/a"

#. ~ Description for Howler
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You frequently let out a piercing howl."
msgstr "Frecuentemente, dejas escapar un aullido agudo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Feathered Arms"
msgstr "Brazos con Plumas"

#. ~ Description for Feathered Arms
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your arms have grown vibrantly colored feathers.  They effectively "
"waterproof your arms and take the edge off hits, but really get in the way."
"  They're simply too small to help you in the air."
msgstr ""
"En tus brazos han crecido unas plumas de colores brillantes. Impermeabilizan"
" tus brazos de manera eficaz y suavizan los golpes, pero son bastante "
"incómodos. Las plumas son muy pequeñas como para permitirte volar."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Insect Limbs"
msgstr "Miembros de Insecto"

#. ~ Description for Insect Limbs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've *finally* sprouted a pair of arms from your midsection.  They flail "
"more-or-less uncontrollably, making you feel rather larval."
msgstr ""
"Te han salido, por fin, unos brazos desde el abdomen. Se agitan más o menos "
"descontroladamente, lo que te hace sentir bastante como una larva."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Insect Arms"
msgstr "Brazos de Insecto"

#. ~ Description for Insect Arms
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's good having all your arms.  Though they're too thin to block or punch, "
"you can fold them inside human-shaped gear if need be."
msgstr ""
"Está bueno tener todos tus brazos. Aunque son muy flacos para defenderte o "
"golpear, los puedes doblar dentro de la ropa para humano, si lo necesitas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Arachnid Limbs"
msgstr "Miembros de Arácnido"

#. ~ Description for Arachnid Limbs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There's the last two limbs you were expecting.  Unfortunately you still "
"can't coordinate them, so you're getting in your own way.  A lot."
msgstr ""
"Aparecieron los últimos dos miembros que estabas esperando. Lamentablemente,"
" todavía no los puedes coordinar, así que te molestan bastante. Bastante "
"mucho."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Arachnid Arms"
msgstr "Brazos de Arácnido"

#. ~ Description for Arachnid Arms
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have four handsome limbs, and then those mutant 'hand' and 'foot' "
"things.  They probably aren't worth concealing."
msgstr ""
"Tienes cuatro espléndidos miembros, y también esa especie de manos y pies "
"mutantes. No parece necesario tener que ocultarlos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tentacle Arms"
msgstr "Brazos de Tentáculos"

#. ~ Description for Tentacle Arms
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your arms have transformed into tentacles, resulting in a bonus of 1 to "
"Dexterity, permanent hand encumbrance of 30, and inability to wear gloves.  "
"Somewhat decreases wet penalties."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You slap %s with your tentacle"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s slaps %2$s with their tentacle"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You rake %s with your tentacle"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s rakes %2$s with their tentacle"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "4 Tentacles"
msgstr "4 Tentáculos"

#. ~ Description for 4 Tentacles
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your arms have transformed into four tentacles, resulting in a bonus of 1 to"
" Dexterity, permanent hand encumbrance of 30, and inability to wear gloves."
"  You can make up to 3 extra attacks with them.  Somewhat decreases wet "
"penalties."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "8 Tentacles"
msgstr "8 Tentáculos"

#. ~ Description for 8 Tentacles
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your arms have transformed into eight tentacles, resulting in a bonus of 1 "
"to Dexterity, permanent hand encumbrance of 30, and inability to wear "
"gloves.  You can make up to 7 extra attacks with them.  Somewhat decreases "
"wet penalties."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Shell"
msgstr "Caparazón"

#. ~ Description for Shell
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have grown a thick shell over your torso, providing excellent armor.  "
"You find you can use the empty space as 16 storage space, but cannot wear "
"anything on your torso.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Te ha crecido un caparazón grueso sobre tu torso, que funciona como una "
"excelente armadura. Además, puedes usar el espacio vacío incrementando tu "
"capacidad de almacenamiento en 16 puntos, pero no te puedes poner nada en el"
" torso. De alguna manera, disminuye las penalidades por estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Roomy Shell"
msgstr "Caparazón Amplio"

#. ~ Description for Roomy Shell
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your protective shell has grown large enough to accommodate--if need be--"
"your whole body.  Activate to pull your head and limbs into your shell, "
"trading mobility and vision for warmth and shelter."
msgstr ""
"Tu caparazón protector ha crecido tan grande como para meter tu cuerpo "
"entero, si lo necesitas. Hay que activarlo para meter tu cabeza y tus brazos"
" adentro, ganando abrigo y refugio, y perdiendo movilidad y visión."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Leg Tentacles"
msgstr "Piernas de Tentáculos"

#. ~ Description for Leg Tentacles
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your legs have transformed into six tentacles.  This decreases your speed on"
" land by 20%, makes your movement silent, increases your swimming speed, and"
" reduces wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"Tus piernas se han transformado en seis tentáculos. Esto disminuye tu "
"velocidad a pie en un 20%, pero te hace silencioso cuando caminas, aumenta "
"tu velocidad de nado, y reduce las penalidades por estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tentacle Bracing"
msgstr "Soporte Tentacular"

#. ~ Description for Tentacle Bracing
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your lower-tentacles have developed suckers.  They make land movement "
"marginally more tiring, but do a good job of keeping you set in place."
msgstr ""
"Tus tentáculos inferiores han desarrollado ventosas. Estas causan que tu "
"movimiento sea ligeramente más cansador, pero hacen un buen trabajo para "
"mantenerte fijo en un lugar."

#. ~ Description for Lizard
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You sometimes look back on your days before your tail came in.  But you're "
"better now."
msgstr ""
"A veces rememorás tus días antes de que te creciera la cola. Pero ahora "
"estás mejor."

#. ~ Description for Bird
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're sure you'll fly someday.  In the meantime, there are still nests to "
"build."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Aquatic"
msgstr "Acuático/a"

#. ~ Description for Aquatic
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ninety percent of the planet, and it's yours to explore.  And colonize.  And"
" enjoy.  What was that about a surface?"
msgstr ""
"90 por ciento del planeta, y es todo tuyo para explorarlo. Y colonizarlo. Y "
"disfrutarlo. ¿Qué era eso de una superficie?"

#. ~ Description for Beast
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's about time you grew out.  Now that you've matured, it is time to make "
"something of yourself."
msgstr ""
"Ya era hora de que crecieras. Ahora que maduraste, es momento de hacer algo "
"de ti mismo."

#. ~ Description for Feline
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Stalking prey, eating well, and lying in the sun.  Mmm, all you could ever "
"desire."
msgstr ""
"Acechar a la presa, comer bien, y tirarte al sol. Mmm, todo lo que siempre "
"deseaste."

#. ~ Description for Wolf
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You're the perfect candidate to lead a pack."
msgstr "Eres el candidato perfecto para liderar una manada."

#. ~ Description for Bear
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "So the humans died, what's the worry?  Now they won't ruin the woods."
msgstr ""
"Así que los humanos murieron, ¿cuál es la preocupación? Ya no arruinarán los"
" bosques."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bovine"
msgstr "Bovino"

#. ~ Description for Bovine
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Civilization collapsed?  Great!  You and your kin will never have to worry "
"about a slaughterhouse again."
msgstr ""
"¿La civilización colapsó? ¡Genial! Tú y tus familiares nunca tendrán que "
"volver a preocuparse por un matadero."

#. ~ Description for Insect
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It would be good to be a Queen, having workers constantly servicing your "
"every need...but how would you keep them in line?"
msgstr ""
"Estaría bueno ser Reina, tener a los obreros constantemente a tu servicio..."
" pero ¿cómo haces para mantenerlos controlados?"

#. ~ Description for Plant
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Well, you still have those other walking flowers-and the mushrooms too-to "
"deal with.  But you'll manage."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, todavía tienes que ocuparte de esas otras flores que caminan, y "
"también de los hongos. Pero lo vas a resolver."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Aqueous"
msgstr "Acuoso"

#. ~ Description for Aqueous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What was that old advertisement, 'paint the planet'? That might be a good "
"long-term goal, but for now..."
msgstr ""
"¿Cómo era esa publicidad vieja, 'pintar el planeta'? Eso puede ser un buen "
"objetivo a largo plazo, pero por ahora..."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Subterranean"
msgstr "Subterráneo/a"

#. ~ Description for Subterranean
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Not much point to rebuilding up in that horribly bright roofless wasteland."
"  Now that you've become accustomed to your new digs, there's the beginnings"
" of a great empire right here, underground."
msgstr ""
"No tiene mucho sentido reconstruir en ese baldío sin techo y horriblemente "
"brillante. Ahora que te acostumbraste a tus nuevos aposentos, aquí están las"
" bases de un gran imperio, subterráneo."

#. ~ Description for Cephalopod
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Strange aeons, true, but Death seems to be slacking and you are doing just "
"fine."
msgstr ""
"Son eones extraños, es cierto, pero la Muerte parece estar ganduleando y tú "
"la vas llevando bien."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Arachnid"
msgstr "Arácnido"

#. ~ Description for Arachnid
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Well, maybe you'll just have to make your own world wide web."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, tal vez tengas que hacer tu propia telaraña informática mundial."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente"

#. ~ Description for Survivor
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Hey.  Civilization fell.  You're still around.  'Rat' just isn't respectful."
msgstr ""
"¡Eh! La civilización cayó. Todavía andas dando vueltas. 'Rata' es faltarte "
"el respeto."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Prototype"
msgstr "Prototipo"

#. ~ Description for Prototype
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "After all those experiments, what's a few more, hmm?"
msgstr "Después de todos esos experimentos, ¿Qué te hacen un par más, eh?"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Prime"
msgstr "Supremo"

#. ~ Description for Prime
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You're the perfect candidate to tidy this mess."
msgstr "Eres el candidato perfecto para ordenar este barullo."

#. ~ Description for Fey
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are the tree under which humankind will shelter during these dark times."
msgstr ""
"Eres el árbol debajo del cual la humanidad se refugiará durante estos "
"tiempos oscuros."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Chaos"
msgstr "Caos"

#. ~ Description for Chaos
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can't tell what you are anymore.  Everything and yet nothing, like you "
"weren't meant to exist.  But you do, and you're a force, no matter what "
"happens."
msgstr ""
"Ya no sabes qué eres. Todo y también anda, como si no hubieras debido "
"existir. Pero existes, y eres una fuerza, no importa lo que pase."

#. ~ Description for Raptor
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chance to undo not one but TWO extinction events.  You're confident "
"you'll do fine."
msgstr ""
"La posibilidad de enmendar no uno, sino DOS extinciones. Tienes confianza "
"que lo vas a hacer bien."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Diminutive"
msgstr "Diminutivo"

#. ~ Description for Diminutive
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"So much food, everywhere!  And nobody's even guarding it anymore!  These are"
" good times."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Marloss Gateway"
msgstr "Entrada Marloss"

#. ~ Description for Marloss Gateway
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You get the feeling that you're on the cusp of becoming something greater "
"than yourself."
msgstr ""
"Tienes la sensación de estar en la cúspide de convertirte en algo más grande"
" que ti mismo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mycus"
msgstr "Mycus"

#. ~ Description for Mycus
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py src/iuse.cpp
msgid "We are the Mycus."
msgstr "Nosotros somos el Mycus."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Acidproof"
msgstr "Antiácido"

#. ~ Description for Acidproof
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your mutated flesh is immune to the damaging effects of acid."
msgstr "Tu carne mutada es inmune a los daños causados por el ácido."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Acid Blood"
msgstr "Sangre Ácida"

#. ~ Description for Acid Blood
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body has developed a wonderful defense mechanism.  Instead of normal "
"blood, you bleed a strong molecular acid which will damage any creature "
"foolish enough to harm you."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo ha desarrollado un maravilloso mecanismo de defensa. En lugar de "
"tener sangre normal, te corre por las venas un ácido molecular fuerte que "
"dañará a cualquier criatura que sea lo suficientemente estúpida de "
"lastimarte."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pyromaniac"
msgstr "Pirómano"

#. ~ Description for Pyromaniac
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have an unhealthy obsession with fire, and you get anxious if you don't "
"light them every now and then or stand near them often.  However, you gain a"
" mood bonus from doing so."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Amphibious"
msgstr "Anfibio"

#. ~ Description for Amphibious
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're as comfortable in water as on land, and your body has adapted around "
"that fact.  Your base swimming speed is greatly increased, and weight will "
"hinder you much less while swimming."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Lidless Eyes"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Lidless Eyes
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Like a true fish, your eyes lack eyelids, and are are instead covered by a "
"translucent, protective membrane that blocks irritants and water, and "
"provides minor armor.  It also allows you to sleep with your eyes open!  "
"Activate to cause the approach of hostile creatures to wake you up."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Aqueous Repose"
msgstr "Descanso Acuoso"

#. ~ Description for Aqueous Repose
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Falling asleep underwater is easy for you, and you spend less time asleep "
"when you rest there.  You can also eat underwater, though you can't drink."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Toxic Flesh"
msgstr "Carne tóxica"

#. ~ Description for Toxic Flesh
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your flesh is highly poisonous, and creatures that bite you will receive a "
"nasty surprise."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Freshwater Osmosis"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Freshwater Osmosis
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your gills and skin are highly permeable to moisture, and you can hydrate "
"your body through osmosis.  While submerged in fresh water, any thirst you "
"might have will be slaked."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Electroreceptors"
msgstr "Electroreceptores"

#. ~ Description for Electroreceptors
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A network of jelly-filled electroreceptors, like that of a shark, have grown"
" throughout your face and nose.  They are very sensitive to magnetic fields,"
" allowing you to see robots and creatures charged with electricity through "
"walls, but being shocked will seriously mess you up."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Shark Teeth"
msgstr "Dientes de Tiburón"

#. ~ Description for Shark Teeth
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your teeth have grown incredibly sharp and are formed of very dense calcium "
"material.  In addition to making you eat much faster, you can use them as a "
"lethal natural weapon, as long as your anatomy favors it.  They also grow "
"very fast, and you harmlessly shed them more or less at random."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You tear into %s with your teeth"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their teeth"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Police Officer"
msgstr "Agente de Policía"

#. ~ Description for Police Officer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are a duly sworn law enforcement officer, with jurisdiction throughout "
"the New England region thanks to interstate agreements.  Whether that means "
"anything now is another question."
msgstr ""
"Eres un agente de la ley bajo juramento, con jurisdicción en toda la región "
"de New England, gracias a los acuerdos interestatales. Que esto signifique "
"algo ahora, eso ya es otra cosa."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "SWAT Officer"
msgstr "Agente de SWAT"

#. ~ Description for SWAT Officer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are a duly sworn law enforcer, with jurisdiction throughout the New "
"England region thanks to interstate agreements.  Whether that means anything"
" now is another question."
msgstr ""
"Eres un agente de la ley bajo juramento, con jurisdicción en toda la región "
"de New England, gracias a los acuerdos interestatales. Que esto signifique "
"algo ahora, eso ya es otra cosa."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bionic Officer"
msgstr "Agente Biónico"

#. ~ Description for Bionic Officer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are a cybernetically-resurrected law enforcer, with jurisdiction "
"throughout the New England region thanks to interstate agreements.  Whether "
"you can do for the law what the law did for you is another question."
msgstr ""
"Eres un agente de la ley resucitado cibernéticamente, con jurisdicción en "
"toda la región de New England, gracias a los acuerdos interestatales. Que "
"esto signifique algo ahora, eso ya es otra cosa."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Churl"
msgstr "Tosco"

#. ~ Description for Churl
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Thou art a lewede man, a lowly cowherd, though where thi catel been thou "
"hast not ynn certain."
msgstr ""
"Tú eres un hombre común, humilde pastor, aunque donde haya estado tu ganado,"
" no lo has de podido saber."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Police Detective"
msgstr "Detective de Policía"

#. ~ Description for Police Detective
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are a duly sworn law enforcement investigator, with jurisdiction "
"throughout the New England region thanks to interstate agreements.  Whether "
"your shield means anything now is another question."
msgstr ""
"Eres un agente de la ley bajo juramento, con jurisdicción en toda la región "
"de New England, gracias a los acuerdos interestatales. Que esto signifique "
"algo ahora, eso ya es otra cosa."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "US Marshal"
msgstr "Alguacil de EE.UU."

#. ~ Description for US Marshal
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are a duly sworn Federal marshal, with nationwide jurisdiction and the "
"authority of the United States of America."
msgstr ""
"Eres un alguacil federal bajo juramento, con jurisdicción en toda la nación "
"y la autoridad en los Estados Unidos de América."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "MD"
msgstr "Doctor en Medicina"

#. ~ Description for MD
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You were just through with the administrative formalities for your residency"
" when the Cataclysm struck.  \"Your\" hospital was overrun and evacuated, "
"but there's always work for a good doctor."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Skater"
msgstr "Skater"

#. ~ Description for Skater
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You spent a lot of time actively maneuvering on skates before the Cataclysm,"
" and are better at staying on your feet when checked or blocked."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Martial Artist"
msgstr "Artista Marcial"

#. ~ Description for Martial Artist
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You were shaping up to be a pretty decent student of the martial arts before"
" the Cataclysm struck.  Time to see just how good you really are."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Black Belt"
msgstr "Cinturón Negro"

#. ~ Description for Black Belt
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You were competitive at national levels, and had considered teaching your "
"art.  Defending against the entire town may still be a challenge, though."
msgstr ""
"Estabas compitiendo a niveles nacionales, y consideraste enseñar tu arte. "
"Igual, defenderte contra el pueblo entero puede ser un desafío importante."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pugilist"
msgstr "Pugilista"

#. ~ Description for Pugilist
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are experienced in the Sweet Science of boxing.  You could've had a shot"
" at a local boxing tournament, if the Cataclysm hadn't screwed that up."
msgstr ""
"Tienes práctica en la Dulce Ciencia del boxeo. Podrías haber tenido éxito en"
" el torneo local de boxeo, si el Cataclismo no lo hubiera jodido."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Autodoc Specialist"
msgstr "Especialista en Autodoc"

#. ~ Description for Autodoc Specialist
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're trained in proper operation of the Autodoc, an advanced machine used "
"for surgical procedures.  Operations involving it will be moderately more "
"likely to succeed."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Dungeon Master"
msgstr "Maestro de mazmorra"

#. ~ Description for Dungeon Master
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Weeks spent picking through manuals and researching topics you aren't versed"
" in has taught you to find what you need to know more quickly.  You read "
"slightly faster, and suffer no reading time penalty for books too complex "
"for you to easily understand."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Carries Brandy"
msgstr "Lleva Brandy"

#. ~ Description for Carries Brandy
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "This Bartender now carries brandy!"
msgstr "¡Este Barman ahora tiene brandy!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Carries Rum"
msgstr "Lleva Ron"

#. ~ Description for Carries Rum
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "This Bartender now carries rum!"
msgstr "¡Este Barman ahora tiene ron!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Carries Whiskey"
msgstr "Lleva Whisky"

#. ~ Description for Carries Whiskey
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "This Bartender now carries whiskey!"
msgstr "¡Este Barman ahora tiene whisky!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Has Level 1 Companion Missions"
msgstr "Tiene Misiones de Compañero Nivel 1"

#. ~ Description for Has Level 1 Companion Missions
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "New mission options have become available!"
msgstr "¡Están disponibles nuevas opciones de misiones!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Has Level 1 Construction Built"
msgstr "Tiene Construcciones Nivel 1"

#. ~ Description for Has Level 1 Construction Built
#. ~ Description for Has Level 2 Construction Built
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "New options may have become available!"
msgstr "¡Pueden estar disponibles nuevas opciones de misiones!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Has Level 2 Construction Built"
msgstr "Tiene Construcciones Nivel 2"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Starting NPC"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Starting NPC
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Marker for starting NPCs"
msgstr "Marca para los PNJ del comienzo del juego"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Static NPC"
msgstr "PNJ estático"

#. ~ Description for Static NPC
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Marker for static NPCs"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Vision"
msgstr "Visión Debug"

#. ~ Description for Debug Vision
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You can clearly see that this is for dev purposes only."
msgstr ""
"Claramente, te das cuenta que esto es solo para propósitos de desarrollo del"
" software."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Invisibility"
msgstr "Invisibilidad Debug"

#. ~ Description for Debug Invisibility
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "If you see this, you'd best be debugging something."
msgstr "Si ves esto, te convendría estar buscando los bugs."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Life Support"
msgstr "Soporte Vital para Debug"

#. ~ Description for Debug Life Support
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Holds hunger, thirst, and fatigue stable.  You can debug all year long with "
"this one!"
msgstr ""
"Mantiene estable el hambre, la sed y el cansacio. ¡Puedes arreglar bugs todo"
" el año con esto!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Deodorizer"
msgstr "Desodorante para Debug"

#. ~ Description for Debug Deodorizer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Smell that bug?  Smell's certainly not coming from you!"
msgstr "¿Hueles ese bug? ¡Ese olor no sale de ti!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Silent Walk"
msgstr "Sigiloso Debug"

#. ~ Description for Debug Silent Walk
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Be vewwy vewwy quiet.  We're hunting bugs."
msgstr "Shhh... no hagas ruido. Estamos cazando bugs."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug HVAC"
msgstr "Debug HVAC"

#. ~ Description for Debug HVAC
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Temperature and weather won't bug you."
msgstr "La temperatura y el calor no te van a molestar. Tampoco los bugs."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Invincibility"
msgstr "Invulnerabilidad Debug"

#. ~ Description for Debug Invincibility
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bug repellent forcefield."
msgstr "Campo de fuerza repelente de bugs."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Hammerspace"
msgstr "Debug Hammerspace"

#. ~ Description for Debug Hammerspace
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Crafting and construction requirements bugger off with this one.  Apply with"
" care."
msgstr ""
"Con esto, no existen los requisitos para fabricar o construir. Manejar con "
"cuidado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Mind Control"
msgstr "Control Mental Debug"

#. ~ Description for Debug Mind Control
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mind the bugs, would you kindly?"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Carrying Capacity"
msgstr "Debug de Capacidad de Carga"

#. ~ Description for Debug Carrying Capacity
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Lets you carry 15 bugs worth of your body weight in your mandibles."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Bionic Installation"
msgstr "Debug Intalación Biónicos"

#. ~ Description for Debug Bionic Installation
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Lets you instantly install torsion ratchets for your eight legs."
msgstr ""
"Te permite instalar instantáneamente engranajes de torsión en tus ocho "
"patas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Bionic Power"
msgstr "Debug Energía Biónica"

#. ~ Description for Debug Bionic Power
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"For fueling your inner cybug.  Activate to increase power capacity by 100 "
"(can be repeated.)"
msgstr ""
"Para alimentar tu cybug interior. Activalo para incrementar la capacidad de "
"energía en 100 (puede ser repetido)."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Squeamish"
msgstr "Delicado"

#. ~ Description for Squeamish
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can't even think about putting filthy clothes on yourself, especially "
"from zombies' corpses."
msgstr ""
"Ni siquiera soportas la idea de ponerte ropas sucias, especialmente las que "
"estuvieron en el cuerpo de un zombi."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Bee"
