msgid "Need help with anything?"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"No, no... Well, maybe a little.  It was just as wrecked down here as it is "
"up top when I found it, wasn't too hard to fix up.  You're welcome to stay "
"in the spare room awhile, just don't hog it.  You're not the only scav out "
