#: src/mission_companion.cpp
msgid ""
"Profit: $25-$500\n"
"Danger: Low\n"
"Time: 10 hour missions\n"
" \n"
"Assigning one of your allies to patrol the surrounding wilderness and isolated buildings presents the opportunity to build survival skills while engaging in relatively safe combat against isolated creatures."
msgstr ""
"Beneficios: 20.73€-414.59€\n"
"Peligro: Bajo\n"
"Tiempo: 10 horas misiones\n"
" \n"
"Asignar uno de tus compañeros a patrullar los alrededores y los edificios aislados le da la oportunidad de mejorar las habilidades en supervivencia mientras combate relativamente a salvo contra criaturas aisladas."

#: src/mission_companion.cpp
msgid "Assign Scavenging Patrol"
msgstr ""

