msgstr "Pierdes un poco de sangre."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "<npcname> loses some blood."
msgstr "<npcname> pierde un poco de sangre."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel a little strange."
msgstr "Te sientes un poco extraño."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "The world takes on a dreamlike quality."
msgstr "El mundo adopta una similitud a los sueños."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You have a sudden nostalgic feeling."
msgstr "De repente, te asalta un sentimiento de nostalgia."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Everything around you is starting to breathe."
msgstr "Todo empieza a respirar alrededor tuyo."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Something feels very, very wrong."
msgstr "Algo parece estar mal, muy mal."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel sick to your stomach."
msgstr "Te sientes mal del estómago."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "\"I think it's starting to kick in.\""
msgstr "\"Creo que está empezando a hacer efecto.\""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "\"Oh God, what's happening?\""
msgstr "\"Oh Dios, ¿qué está pasando?\""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "\"Of course... it's all fractals!\""
msgstr "\"Por supuesto... ¡son todos fractales!\""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "\"Huh?  What was that?\""
msgstr "\"¿Eh? ¿Qué fue eso?\""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Fractal patterns dance across your vision."
msgstr "Adelante de tus ojos, comienzan a bailar estructuras fractales."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Dancing fractals distract you."
msgstr "Fractales danzantes te distraen."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Everything looks SO boring now."
msgstr "Ahora todo parece MUY aburrido."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Things are returning to normal."
msgstr "Las cosas vuelven a la normalidad."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your thoughts are unclear."
msgstr "Tus pensamientos están nublados."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your face is stiff from the cold."
msgstr "Tienes la cara dura de frío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You quiver from the cold."
msgstr "Estás temblando de frío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your torso is freezing cold. You should put on a few more layers."
msgstr ""
"Se te está congelando el torso. Tendrías que ponerte algo más de ropa."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your shivering makes you unsteady."
msgstr "Los escalofríos te hacen temblar."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left arm is shivering."
msgstr "Te tiembla el brazo izquierdo."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left arm trembles from the cold."
msgstr "Tu brazo izquierdo se estremece por el frío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right arm is shivering."
msgstr "Te tiembla el brazo derecho."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right arm trembles from the cold."
msgstr "Tu brazo derecho se estremece por el frío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left hand feels like ice."
msgstr "Tienes la mano izquierda helada."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left hand quivers in the cold."
msgstr "Tu mano izquierda tiembla por el frío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right hand feels like ice."
msgstr "Tienes la mano derecha helada."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right hand quivers in the cold."
msgstr "Tu mano derecha se estremece por el frío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left leg trembles against the relentless cold."
msgstr "Tu pierna izquierda se estremece por el frío implacable."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your legs uncontrollably shake from the cold."
msgstr "Tus piernas tiemblan descontroladamente por el frío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right leg trembles against the relentless cold."
msgstr "Tu pierna derecha se estremece por el frío implacable."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left foot feels frigid."
msgstr "Tu pie izquierdo está gélido."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left foot is as nimble as a block of ice."
msgstr "Tu pie izquierdo está como un bloque de hielo."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your freezing left foot messes up your balance."
msgstr "Pierdes un poco el balance por tener el pie izquierdo helado."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right foot feels frigid."
msgstr "Tu pie derecho está gélido."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right foot is as nimble as a block of ice."
msgstr "Tu pie derecho está como un bloque de hielo."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your freezing right foot messes up your balance."
msgstr "Pierdes un poco el balance por tener el pie derecho helado."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your head is pounding from the heat."
msgstr "Sientes un martilleo en tu cabeza debido al calor."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You are sweating profusely."
msgstr "Estás transpirando como testigo falso."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left hand's too sweaty to grip well."
msgstr "Tu mano izquierda está patinosa por la transpiración."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right hand's too sweaty to grip well."
msgstr "Tu mano derecha está patinosa por la transpiración."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left leg is cramping up."
msgstr "Sientes un calambre en la pierna izquierda."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right leg is cramping up."
msgstr "Sientes un calambre en la pierna derecha."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left foot is swelling in the heat."
msgstr "Sientes el pie izquierdo hinchado por el calor."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right foot is swelling in the heat."
msgstr "Sientes el pie derecho hinchado por el calor."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "The heat is making you see things."
msgstr "El calor te está haciendo ver cosas."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You have trouble grasping with your numb fingers."
msgstr "Te cuesta agarrar cosas con los dedos dormidos."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your foot has gone numb."
msgstr "Se te durmió el pie."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your face feels numb."
msgstr "Sientes la cara adormecida."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your flesh crawls; insects tear through the flesh and begin to emerge!"
msgstr ""
"Tu carne está plagada de bichos. ¡Insectos desgarran tu piel y empiezan a "
"brotar!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Insects begin to emerge from <npcname>'s skin!"
msgstr "¡Insectos empiezan a brotar de la piel de <npcname>!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Dermatik eggs hatched."
msgstr "Huevos eclosionados de dermatik."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Dermatik eggs hatched."
msgstr "Huevos eclosionados de dermatik."

#. ~ %s is bodypart in accusative.
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You start scratching your %s!"
msgstr "¡Te rascas tu %s!"

#. ~ 1$s is NPC name, 2$s is bodypart in accusative.
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s starts scratching their %2$s!"
msgstr "¡%1$s se está rascando su %2$s!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Why waste your time on that insignificant speck?"
msgstr "¿Para qué vas a gastar tiempo en esa mancha insignificante?"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "A monster appears nearby!"
msgstr "¡Aparece un monstruo cerca!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "A portal opens nearby, and a monster crawls through!"
msgstr "¡Un portal se abre cerca, y un monstruo aparece arrastrándose!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "The bees have started escaping your teeth."
msgstr "Las abejas empezaron a escaparse de tus dientes."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel paranoid.  They're watching you."
msgstr "Te sientes paranoico. Te están observando."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You feel like you need less teeth.  You pull one out, and it is rotten to "
"the core."
msgstr ""
"Sientes como si necesitaras menos dientes. Te sacas uno, y está podrido "
"desde la raíz."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You notice a large abscess.  You pick at it."
msgstr "Te encontraste un absceso grande. Lo pellizcas."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You feel so sick, like you've been poisoned, but you need more.  So much "
"more."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes muy enfermo, como si hubieras sido envenenado, pero necesitas "
"más. Mucho más."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Glowing lights surround you, and you teleport."
msgstr "Te rodean luces brillantes, y te teletransportás."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Spontaneous teleport."
msgstr "Teletransportación espontánea."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Spontaneous teleport."
msgstr "Teletransportación espontánea."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You pass out."
msgstr "Te desmayaste."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You shudder suddenly."
msgstr "De repente, sientes un escalofrío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your vision is filled with bright lights..."
msgstr "Tu visión se llena de luces brillantes..."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You're suddenly covered in ectoplasm."
msgstr "De repente, estás cubierto de ectoplasma."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "We have many colonists awaiting passage."
msgstr "Tenemos muchos colonos esperando un pasaje."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your asthma attack stops."
msgstr "Dejas de tener un ataque de asma."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"Your asthma overcomes you.\n"
"You asphyxiate."
msgstr ""
"Tu asma se vuelve incontrolable.\n"
"Te asfixiaste."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Succumbed to an asthma attack."
msgstr "Sucumbiste a un ataque de asma."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Succumbed to an asthma attack."
msgstr "Sucumbiste a un ataque de asma."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You wheeze and gasp for air."
msgstr "Resoplas y jadeas intentando respirar."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your head aches faintly."
msgstr "Te duele ligeramente la cabeza."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your vision is getting fuzzy."
msgstr "Tu vista se está haciendo borrosa."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your vision goes black!"
msgstr "¡No ves nada más que negro!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your bowels ache."
msgstr "Te duelen los intestinos."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your veins itch."
msgstr "Te pican las venas."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your muscles feel like they're knotted and tired."
msgstr "Sientes tus músculos como si estuvieran atados y cansados."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your muscles are tight and sore."
msgstr "Tus músculos están tensos y te duelen."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your muscles are locking up and you can't fight effectively."
msgstr "Tus músculos se bloquean y no puedes pelear eficazmente."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your muscles spasm."
msgstr "Sientes espasmos musculares."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You're experiencing loss of basic motor skills and blurred vision.  Your "
"mind recoils in horror, unable to communicate with your spinal column."
msgstr ""
"Estás sintiendo una pérdida de tus habilidades motoras básicas, y visión "
"borrosa. Tu mente retrocede espantada, incapaz de comunicarse con tu columna"
" vertebral."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You stagger and fall!"
msgstr "¡Te tambaleas y te caes!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "There's some kind of big machine in the sky."
msgstr "Hay una especie de máquina grande en el cielo."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "It's some kind of electric snake, coming right at you!"
msgstr "Es como una serpiente eléctrica, ¡que viene hacia ti!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"Order us some golf shoes, otherwise we'll never get out of this place alive."
msgstr "Pídenos unos zapatos de golf, o nunca saldremos vivos de aquí."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "The possibility of physical and mental collapse is now very real."
msgstr "Ahora te parece muy real la posibilidad del colapso físico y mental."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "No one should be asked to handle this trip."
msgstr "No se le tendría que pedir a nadie que haga este viaje."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"Your heart spasms painfully and stops, dragging you back to reality as you "
"die."
msgstr ""
"Sientes espasmos dolorosos en tu corazón, y se detiene, arrastrándote hacia "
"la realidad mientras te mueres."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You dissolve into beautiful paroxysms of energy.  Life fades from your "
"nebulae and you are no more."
msgstr ""
"Te disuelves en hermosos paroxismos de energía. La vida se desvanece de tu "
"nebulosa y ya no existes más."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Died of datura overdose."
msgstr "Murió por sobredosis de datura."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Died of datura overdose."
msgstr "Murió por sobredosis de datura."

